1
00:02:02,118 --> 00:02:09,198
Contact: turkision@gmail.com

2
00:02:12,366 --> 00:02:17,125
Thanks to my Allah, He let us see these days.

3
00:02:17,646 --> 00:02:19,845
What else could I expect?

4
00:02:20,446 --> 00:02:24,965
If we are allies now, then..

5
00:02:25,526 --> 00:02:29,245
...we should seek fights and conquests.

6
00:02:29,926 --> 00:02:35,965
We should. May our alliance be forever,
if Allah permits!

7
00:02:36,566 --> 00:02:40,365
Bring the bards! Play music!

8
00:02:40,446 --> 00:02:44,245
Sing songs! Come on! Come on!

9
00:02:57,606 --> 00:03:03,285
Kanyumaz, send messages to beys immediately.

10
00:03:03,446 --> 00:03:09,685
Tell them Osman Bey pledged loyalty
and he's with us now.

11
00:03:09,846 --> 00:03:12,285
As you order my Bey.

12
00:03:18,406 --> 00:03:21,165
My Bey, messenger of Mugla is here.

13
00:03:21,446 --> 00:03:25,645
How dare you come in without permission?

14
00:03:38,566 --> 00:03:45,685
Who are you? How dare you come into my tent like this?

15
00:04:05,326 --> 00:04:11,885
I take my daring from the Ilkhanid State.

16
00:04:24,886 --> 00:04:28,365
I'm the messenger of Olcaytu Khan.

17
00:04:49,526 --> 00:04:53,645
Who do you take your daring from, Yakup Bey?

18
00:05:02,926 --> 00:05:05,685
You can have the daring.

19
00:05:06,966 --> 00:05:11,925
Who did you take permission from
and you declared yourself as the sultan?

20
00:05:11,926 --> 00:05:16,365
Only Emirs take permissions, not Sultans.

21
00:05:18,326 --> 00:05:20,925
Tell me about your matter...

22
00:05:21,166 --> 00:05:24,405
...and you may have a long life, Messenger!

23
00:05:25,766 --> 00:05:29,005
If you come forward as the sultan,

24
00:05:29,366 --> 00:05:32,445
..then you have to pay tax.

25
00:05:32,926 --> 00:05:39,485
Now you will pay the tax that
Sultan Mesud has paid so far.

26
00:05:39,806 --> 00:05:42,645
Stop there!

27
00:05:43,686 --> 00:05:49,285
How could you demand the tax Yakup Bey didn't collect?

28
00:05:49,846 --> 00:05:52,365
You came down here like a vulture!

29
00:05:52,646 --> 00:05:56,605
You must be Osman.

30
00:05:56,926 --> 00:06:02,205
Yes. If you know my name,
you must also know about my reputation.

31
00:06:02,286 --> 00:06:05,005
I know. I know.

32
00:06:05,166 --> 00:06:10,365
You gave our commanders and governors a hard time.

33
00:06:12,646 --> 00:06:17,205
-Is Osman Bey with you, Yakup Bey?
-He is.

34
00:06:17,646 --> 00:06:20,045
We have alliance in our land.

35
00:06:20,286 --> 00:06:23,685
Good. Good.

36
00:06:24,766 --> 00:06:29,605
Apart from your yearly tax 50.000 dirham gold coins,

37
00:06:30,486 --> 00:06:35,965
...you will pay 20.000 dirhams more
as the price of the blood Osman shed.

38
00:06:41,046 --> 00:06:44,885
-You have two days.
-Messenger!

39
00:06:46,126 --> 00:06:51,725
Look at me. If you go beyond being a messenger...

40
00:06:52,166 --> 00:06:55,525
...and try to rule,

41
00:06:56,406 --> 00:06:59,445
...you will lose your head.

42
00:06:59,606 --> 00:07:04,285
My words are Olcaytu Khan's words.

43
00:07:05,326 --> 00:07:10,845
You shouldn't tell me things that you can't say to him.

44
00:07:12,526 --> 00:07:16,005
You have two days.

45
00:07:25,686 --> 00:07:29,045
Everything you own...

46
00:07:30,286 --> 00:07:35,125
...is yours as long as we want to.

47
00:07:36,886 --> 00:07:40,525
-Don't, Osman Bey.
-Shh...

48
00:07:45,086 --> 00:07:50,525
When we become a state, you will see who's going to pay taxes.

49
00:07:50,606 --> 00:07:53,125
If I bleed,

50
00:07:53,486 --> 00:07:56,805
...this land which you call homeland...

51
00:07:56,966 --> 00:08:01,005
...will be a blood bath.
Come on, do it.

52
00:08:01,206 --> 00:08:04,045
Osman Bey!

53
00:08:18,206 --> 00:08:22,165
Now go! Your gold will come after you!

54
00:08:22,286 --> 00:08:27,285
Two days. Or we'll take it as a riot and destroy you!

55
00:08:39,126 --> 00:08:41,485
Osman Bey!

56
00:08:43,846 --> 00:08:47,285
While you were buying the stands today...

57
00:08:47,686 --> 00:08:53,365
While you were handing out gold coins to people,
you were very carefree.

58
00:08:55,326 --> 00:08:58,845
70.000 dirhams.

59
00:08:59,326 --> 00:09:04,045
As 20.000 is already your price,

60
00:09:04,566 --> 00:09:07,605
...you will pay this tax.

61
00:09:23,846 --> 00:09:28,485
-Help us, my Allah!
-Hold on, brother.

62
00:09:28,686 --> 00:09:33,845
We'll find out who stole the gold and made a slaughter here.

63
00:09:33,886 --> 00:09:38,525
Hold on, brother! Hold on!
You! Are you alright?

64
00:09:38,606 --> 00:09:41,285
I'm fine, my Bey. It's nothing.

65
00:09:41,406 --> 00:09:46,965
We should go see the healer!
Hold on, brother!

66
00:10:23,646 --> 00:10:29,565
That gold will be your death, Bayindir.

67
00:10:39,006 --> 00:10:44,485
Yakup Bey, is this...

68
00:10:45,926 --> 00:10:50,685
..a punishment for me? Or a request?

69
00:10:51,326 --> 00:10:54,285
I should know this first.

70
00:10:54,926 --> 00:10:59,565
Osman Bey, you pledged loyalty.

71
00:11:00,126 --> 00:11:06,685
It's neither a request nor a punishment. It's an order.

72
00:11:19,446 --> 00:11:22,445
Battle is a wedding for us.

73
00:11:23,886 --> 00:11:27,165
A wedding of 70.000 gold coins, huh?

74
00:11:28,446 --> 00:11:34,605
These lands have never seen such a rich wedding.

75
00:11:36,366 --> 00:11:42,645
Keep the other beys out of this. I will pay this for our unity.

76
00:11:42,806 --> 00:11:47,405
For sure, I have enough to pay.

77
00:11:50,086 --> 00:11:53,765
Alright then, Osman Bey.

78
00:11:54,646 --> 00:11:57,845
If you are the Sultan

79
00:11:58,366 --> 00:12:01,485
...you should take care of this tax matter.

80
00:12:01,646 --> 00:12:10,445
Well... Konya collapsed due to the taxes.
If we keep paying this tax,

81
00:12:11,446 --> 00:12:16,165
...nobody can stand this. You should know.

82
00:12:16,566 --> 00:12:21,205
Don't worry.
Everything has a time.

83
00:12:21,246 --> 00:12:24,725
As we kept saying this,

84
00:12:26,006 --> 00:12:28,805
...the enemy jumped on us!

85
00:12:30,206 --> 00:12:36,725
This is our last tax. Gather the beys
and recruit the army.

86
00:12:38,686 --> 00:12:43,805
We'll either come forward like true men
and get rid of our chains...

87
00:12:44,326 --> 00:12:50,205
...or go out of existence for ever.

88
00:12:52,326 --> 00:12:57,365
If you are the Sultan, you'll make the choice.

89
00:12:57,446 --> 00:13:04,005
You go do your duty. I'll do what a Sultan should do.

90
00:13:08,286 --> 00:13:12,045
Bards, play and sing!

91
00:13:27,046 --> 00:13:29,645
Tell me.

92
00:13:40,766 --> 00:13:43,205
Osman Bey.

93
00:13:43,646 --> 00:13:46,405
It doesn't look like good news.

94
00:13:47,566 --> 00:13:50,525
Something troublesome came up.

95
00:13:50,646 --> 00:13:54,485
I hope it's not something to keep you
away from your duty.

96
00:13:55,206 --> 00:14:02,005
No. It won't stop my duty. But we'll be there
at dawn only if we leave now.

97
00:14:03,566 --> 00:14:08,325
-I should go.
-Osman Bey.

98
00:14:09,606 --> 00:14:12,565
Prepare the gold.

99
00:14:13,526 --> 00:14:18,685
Don't disgrace yourself or us against the enemy.

100
00:14:32,766 --> 00:14:36,725
Hold on, brother. Brother?

101
00:14:42,126 --> 00:14:46,605
They... They stole the gold.

102
00:14:46,926 --> 00:14:49,445
-What?
-The gold..

103
00:14:54,766 --> 00:14:59,165
O Shafi (The Healer)! O Allah!

104
00:14:59,406 --> 00:15:03,365
Hold on, brother. Hold on.

105
00:15:42,526 --> 00:15:46,125
We put the gold where you ordered, Master Gera.

106
00:15:50,166 --> 00:15:52,965
What's in your mind, Master Gera?

107
00:15:58,446 --> 00:16:00,805
Cerkutay.

108
00:16:01,926 --> 00:16:07,325
He hates Osman. Boran..

109
00:16:10,486 --> 00:16:13,085
He's fighting for his life.

110
00:16:17,446 --> 00:16:23,285
Our next man is Bayindir Bey.

111
00:16:24,366 --> 00:16:28,525
I will take him away from Osman harshly.

112
00:16:30,366 --> 00:16:33,165
Osman will remain all alone.

113
00:16:33,366 --> 00:16:36,645
We'll do that by using the gold.

114
00:16:38,206 --> 00:16:43,525
The gold... They must be looking for it everywhere.

115
00:16:43,526 --> 00:16:47,005
They will leave no rocks unturned.

116
00:16:48,086 --> 00:16:53,685
Veysel Alp, they will interrogate you too.

117
00:16:53,926 --> 00:16:56,805
Go to the palace in no time.

118
00:16:57,406 --> 00:17:00,525
You will start the game.

119
00:17:05,286 --> 00:17:09,765
What's the situation? Where is Boran?

120
00:17:10,286 --> 00:17:12,565
My Bey.

121
00:17:13,165 --> 00:17:16,005
Konur Bey was at the headquarters.

122
00:17:16,445 --> 00:17:20,845
And I was dealing with the trading books of the stands.

123
00:17:20,965 --> 00:17:27,645
-And?
My Bey, Boran Bey was here.

124
00:17:31,046 --> 00:17:36,605
They stole all the gold and the treasure.

125
00:17:37,966 --> 00:17:40,605
What are you saying?

126
00:17:48,406 --> 00:17:53,765
All the alps guarding it and Boran Bey are in the healing house.

127
00:17:54,486 --> 00:17:57,645
Counting on the gold

128
00:17:58,526 --> 00:18:01,885
...I said I'd pay the tax to Mongolians.

129
00:18:04,726 --> 00:18:09,485
Someone who knew about the treasure did this.
They used the goods entrance.

130
00:18:09,686 --> 00:18:15,325
Yes. Our alps know when the goods are coming in and out.

131
00:18:16,006 --> 00:18:19,245
We weren't expecting any goods in the palace.

132
00:18:19,766 --> 00:18:24,325
So you say it's not weakness, but betrayal.

133
00:18:24,526 --> 00:18:28,125
-You say it's betrayal, huh?
-Yes, my Bey.

134
00:18:40,206 --> 00:18:44,525
With your permission,
we should stop the raids in the west.

135
00:18:45,286 --> 00:18:50,525
-Yes. We should retreat the scouts and Yenisehir...
-Enough!

136
00:18:53,246 --> 00:18:57,165
Will we give up as they hit our treasure? Ha?

137
00:18:57,246 --> 00:19:01,645
Will we stop as they hit our palace and the house?

138
00:19:02,366 --> 00:19:06,605
No way! No!

139
00:19:08,246 --> 00:19:12,965
If any of you feels afraid or doubts,

140
00:19:15,206 --> 00:19:19,485
...he can wait for his death in the arms of his wife!

141
00:19:24,646 --> 00:19:29,965
Nobody will retreat! Close all the exits of Yenisehir.

142
00:19:30,206 --> 00:19:35,605
You'll check come comes in and goes out.
If you suspect anyone,

143
00:19:35,926 --> 00:19:37,965
...you will search thoroughly!

144
00:19:38,046 --> 00:19:40,965
-As you order, my Bey.
-As you order, my Bey.

145
00:19:44,766 --> 00:19:47,645
My Bey

146
00:19:49,006 --> 00:19:51,765
-Speak.
-My Bey.

147
00:19:52,166 --> 00:19:56,125
I heard a location's name when I was wounded.

148
00:19:59,086 --> 00:20:01,085
-Orhan.
-My Bey.

149
00:20:01,126 --> 00:20:05,725
You'll go where Veysel mentions and you'll
find the gold and the traitor.

150
00:20:05,846 --> 00:20:08,765
-As you order, my Bey.
-But...

151
00:20:09,686 --> 00:20:13,885
-You'll go with him.
-As you order, my Bey.

152
00:20:14,126 --> 00:20:16,125
Come on, son.

153
00:20:31,606 --> 00:20:34,605
GERMIYANOGULLARI BORDER

154
00:20:37,686 --> 00:20:40,805
Osman's loyalty is not genuine.

155
00:20:41,886 --> 00:20:46,125
He is just trying to buy time.

156
00:20:47,246 --> 00:20:53,445
Do not fall into carelessness.
Keep your eyes peeled.

157
00:20:56,006 --> 00:20:59,965
That is why gave that tax to Osman as a burden.

158
00:21:00,286 --> 00:21:04,285
Learn well to play tricks from your father, my Mehmet.

159
00:21:04,366 --> 00:21:10,285
I do mother, I do. Act unsuspicious
so they stay close to you.

160
00:21:10,526 --> 00:21:14,965
So that they can stay right beneath your
hands for you to break their necks.

161
00:21:15,206 --> 00:21:19,445
Let them pay their taxes to Mongols..

162
00:21:19,686 --> 00:21:24,405
With the money they got from the treasure of Konya.

163
00:21:24,766 --> 00:21:29,085
-Does Osman Bey has the treasure, father?
-If he doesn't have it..

164
00:21:29,206 --> 00:21:34,645
How could he buy the stalls.
Undertake all those taxes.

165
00:21:34,726 --> 00:21:37,925
Then Orhan was the one hitting me.

166
00:21:38,406 --> 00:21:42,445
I will choke him with my own hands. And I will..

167
00:21:42,566 --> 00:21:47,725
You won't! Don't, Mehmet.

168
00:21:48,246 --> 00:21:54,965
I did my every move with politics.
You will act with politics as well.

169
00:21:55,366 --> 00:21:59,205
I do not want any other moves.

170
00:22:00,766 --> 00:22:07,685
We know the move we are going to make, my Bey.

171
00:22:10,006 --> 00:22:13,925
Since I got my homage from all the beys..

172
00:22:14,006 --> 00:22:18,085
I will wear the robe of Sultanship.

173
00:22:20,366 --> 00:22:25,565
I will give away coins and make my name..

174
00:22:25,766 --> 00:22:29,685
Famous all over the earth in khutbah.

175
00:22:31,526 --> 00:22:37,045
-Am I allowed, Yakup Bey.
-Come in Kutay, come in.

176
00:22:38,966 --> 00:22:42,845
Good morning. Yakup Bey..

177
00:22:43,206 --> 00:22:45,725
-You wanted me.
-Cerkutay.

178
00:22:45,886 --> 00:22:50,525
Yakup Bey! Yakup Bey!

179
00:22:50,686 --> 00:22:55,285
They attacked Osman Bey's palace, that's why they left.

180
00:22:55,446 --> 00:23:01,165
They say his Alp Boran Bey got wounded badly, lingering.

181
00:23:01,446 --> 00:23:05,605
-Does anyone know who did it?
-No one knows, my Bey.

182
00:23:17,006 --> 00:23:23,845
Hatun, get ready quickly. We are going to
Osman Bey to wish him speedy recovery.

183
00:23:27,286 --> 00:23:31,365
Yakup Bey.

184
00:23:31,926 --> 00:23:37,605
With your permission, I shall return to my post.

185
00:23:51,006 --> 00:23:55,605
The enemy is looking for excuses to destroy our land.

186
00:23:55,886 --> 00:24:03,645
If we can not give the gold to Mongols on time,
we'll have to give this excuse ourselves.

187
00:24:04,646 --> 00:24:09,125
They will accuse me for it as well.
As I said there is no need for Beys..

188
00:24:09,366 --> 00:24:12,965
I will pay the tax off.

189
00:24:15,206 --> 00:24:23,085
Now they will accuse me for this war
that is about to break down.

190
00:24:29,766 --> 00:24:33,085
The treasure will surely be found.

191
00:24:34,326 --> 00:24:38,645
However, we have to count the worst scenarios.

192
00:24:39,686 --> 00:24:42,125
-Bayindir.
-My Bey.

193
00:24:42,206 --> 00:24:45,485
Check how much fortresses and castles have money.

194
00:24:45,566 --> 00:24:48,205
To the shops that can be sold..

195
00:24:49,246 --> 00:24:53,805
And even horses. We will give everything we have.

196
00:24:53,966 --> 00:24:58,085
We will not be looked down upon
by our enemies and Yakup Bey.

197
00:24:58,286 --> 00:25:01,645
-As you command, my Bey.
-Konur.

198
00:25:02,006 --> 00:25:06,445
You will have the palace searched again.
As we have a traitor among us..

199
00:25:06,606 --> 00:25:10,365
-We will find him.
-As you command, my Bey.

200
00:25:10,606 --> 00:25:14,685
My Bey, my Bey, My Osman Bey.

201
00:25:14,886 --> 00:25:18,565
-Boran Bey can not breathe.
-What are you saying.

202
00:25:19,166 --> 00:25:20,405
Alaeddin.

203
00:25:30,366 --> 00:25:35,845
-Boran Bey, hang on. Breathe, Boran Bey.
-Boran!

204
00:25:36,886 --> 00:25:39,685
What happened? Healer! Tell me!

205
00:25:39,766 --> 00:25:45,605
My Bey, he had two or three wounds.
We closed and cleaned them all. He was alright...

206
00:25:45,686 --> 00:25:47,485
-But...
-But what?

207
00:25:47,606 --> 00:25:50,285
Now... He cannot breathe, my Bey.

208
00:25:50,406 --> 00:25:56,045
-What is happening? What is happening Alaeddin?
-Any broken bones? Did you check?

209
00:25:56,806 --> 00:26:03,085
Hold him. Turn him over. Turn him.

210
00:26:04,086 --> 00:26:06,645
Come on Boran Bey.

211
00:26:12,646 --> 00:26:15,605
-Hang on brother.
-Come on!

212
00:26:20,206 --> 00:26:27,805
Broken bone... It was stuck there.
Thanks to Allah, he can breathe now.

213
00:26:32,326 --> 00:26:36,645
-He will lay on his one side for some time.
-Yes my Shahzade.

214
00:26:42,046 --> 00:26:43,965
My Bey.

215
00:26:45,566 --> 00:26:47,685
My valiant.

216
00:26:52,246 --> 00:26:57,125
What happened? How did they do this to you?

217
00:26:57,766 --> 00:27:02,285
-He'll be alright, right?
-I hope so, my Bey, I hope so.

218
00:27:05,326 --> 00:27:12,565
He'll be alright. Hang on, Boran. My valiant.

219
00:27:14,846 --> 00:27:18,245
Don't you leave... Look...

220
00:27:18,406 --> 00:27:21,605
Do you remember what you told me?

221
00:27:21,846 --> 00:27:25,045
You said, "My Bey...

222
00:27:25,766 --> 00:27:32,765
..all the things I know will go to grave with me.
" Don't you do that...

223
00:27:33,806 --> 00:27:36,645
Don't... Don't... It's not time.

224
00:27:36,726 --> 00:27:42,325
You cannot go anywhere. Alright?
You cannot go.

225
00:27:44,046 --> 00:27:48,205
Alaeddin... Boran is entrusted to you, my son.

226
00:27:48,486 --> 00:27:51,645
Yes my Bey.

227
00:27:52,286 --> 00:27:56,365
But... I don't know how long he can resist...

228
00:27:56,446 --> 00:28:00,205
...and if he survives until tomorrow, my Bey.

229
00:28:03,686 --> 00:28:06,685
GERMIYANOGULLARI BORDER - FRONTIER BAZAAR

230
00:28:06,806 --> 00:28:09,285
Mother! Mother!

231
00:28:09,366 --> 00:28:12,805
They are going to Osman Bey's palace. Let's go!

232
00:28:12,886 --> 00:28:16,885
-I am curious, mother.
-Stop, my boy.

233
00:28:18,646 --> 00:28:24,605
My dear... I am also curious, I also want to go there.

234
00:28:27,566 --> 00:28:32,165
You are scared of that Cerkutay, right, mother?

235
00:28:37,726 --> 00:28:42,965
Cerkutay Bey! We want to go to Osman Bey's palace!

236
00:28:43,126 --> 00:28:47,525
We will see my uncle Boran. We will go.

237
00:28:47,646 --> 00:28:51,485
Cerk... -We won't go.

238
00:28:56,406 --> 00:29:02,805
My dear... Go to Yakub Bey. Come on.

239
00:29:10,566 --> 00:29:13,525
My Cerkutay...

240
00:29:14,086 --> 00:29:18,085
Don't you think I know that you are suffering?

241
00:29:18,286 --> 00:29:21,085
Come on, don't be stubborn. Let's go.

242
00:29:22,086 --> 00:29:25,965
Boran is your brother. Don't leave him alone.

243
00:29:26,086 --> 00:29:30,565
Brother? Brother, huh?

244
00:29:34,606 --> 00:29:37,165
A brother who thought I was dead...

245
00:29:38,486 --> 00:29:44,285
..and left me behind. No.

246
00:29:45,326 --> 00:29:50,845
None of you understand what I've been through.
Even you.

247
00:29:52,286 --> 00:29:55,005
Cerkutay..

248
00:29:56,366 --> 00:29:59,925
May Allah not let it happen early, but...

249
00:30:00,606 --> 00:30:04,085
...what if Boran
Bey passes away?

250
00:30:06,686 --> 00:30:12,725
The ones I called "My Bey" and "my brothers"..

251
00:30:14,566 --> 00:30:17,925
.left me.

252
00:30:18,886 --> 00:30:22,285
I will ignore them now.

253
00:30:30,246 --> 00:30:34,605
Cerkutay Bey. Come on. You are coming with us.

254
00:30:34,846 --> 00:30:37,285
Yakub Bey, if you allow us...

255
00:30:37,366 --> 00:30:42,565
I said come on, Cerkutay. We are going together.

256
00:30:45,006 --> 00:30:47,845
He said we are going.

257
00:31:09,886 --> 00:31:13,525
Peace and Allah's mercy and blessings
shall be upon you.

258
00:31:13,686 --> 00:31:17,805
-Peace be upon you too.
-Forgive me, please.

259
00:31:17,966 --> 00:31:22,805
I mean, I couldn't help it, I came here after
I heard what happened.

260
00:31:22,966 --> 00:31:28,725
You did good. Thank you, Ayhan Agha, but...

261
00:31:30,566 --> 00:31:33,845
-How did you hear it?
-Everyone heard it.

262
00:31:33,926 --> 00:31:37,605
Everyone is talking about this.

263
00:31:38,846 --> 00:31:41,885
Did you lose a lot?

264
00:31:45,606 --> 00:31:49,925
Please, do not misunderstand me, Bayindir Bey...

265
00:31:50,406 --> 00:31:54,685
I owe a life to Osman Bey .

266
00:31:54,766 --> 00:31:59,005
I did not come here to express my wishes.

267
00:31:59,206 --> 00:32:05,085
Whatever the casualty is, I want to do my best.

268
00:32:05,926 --> 00:32:10,685
Thank you Ayhan Agha. Thank you.

269
00:32:11,126 --> 00:32:16,685
Good then. Let's go to Osman Bey...

270
00:32:17,006 --> 00:32:21,445
...and he will tell you the most suitable thing.
-Sure. Sure.

271
00:32:21,806 --> 00:32:24,565
-Come.
-Here.

272
00:32:24,726 --> 00:32:27,245
Go.

273
00:32:34,806 --> 00:32:39,325
Tell me my Fatma. Is Boran Bey alright?

274
00:32:39,446 --> 00:32:43,885
I hope he will be alright, mother.
My Alaeddin brother is taking care of him.

275
00:32:44,046 --> 00:32:47,965
That's why he couldn't visit you. Don't be offended.

276
00:32:48,206 --> 00:32:53,885
I know, my beautiful daughter. I know.
How can children offend their mothers anyway?

277
00:32:54,086 --> 00:32:58,285
Which mother's heart can take it?

278
00:32:58,646 --> 00:33:04,365
You will drink these in the morning and at night.
My brother thinks about you all the time.

279
00:33:04,446 --> 00:33:08,085
He loves you in a different way, mother.

280
00:33:08,206 --> 00:33:11,965
Yes... He does for now, but...

281
00:33:12,206 --> 00:33:15,885
...once he falls in love, you'll see how he forgets his mother.

282
00:33:15,966 --> 00:33:20,685
He won't. Besides, if he could, he would already.

283
00:33:23,326 --> 00:33:29,205
So you are saying that your brother
Alaeddin is already in love, huh?

284
00:33:29,446 --> 00:33:31,725
-No... I didn't say that.
-You did.

285
00:33:31,926 --> 00:33:34,645
I didn't, mother.
-You did, you did.

286
00:33:34,766 --> 00:33:36,885
Who is that girl?

287
00:33:39,166 --> 00:33:42,405
That's the issue, mother.

288
00:33:42,566 --> 00:33:45,645
I will tell you, but you will not tell my brother. Promise me.

289
00:33:45,726 --> 00:33:50,005
Promise, my daughter. Come on, tell me.

290
00:33:50,606 --> 00:33:55,365
Germiyanoglu Yakub Bey's daughter Gonca.

291
00:33:56,246 --> 00:34:00,685
-Fatma, what are you saying?
-I saw my brother’s eyes.

292
00:34:00,806 --> 00:34:04,525
He loves that girl.

293
00:34:05,766 --> 00:34:10,525
Yakub Bey and his family.. It is too hard.

294
00:34:10,646 --> 00:34:13,885
-It is too hard, my Fatma.
-I know, I know mother.

295
00:34:14,005 --> 00:34:17,005
And since my father pledged allegiance...

296
00:34:19,406 --> 00:34:22,764
What if it is a trap? Huh?

297
00:34:23,525 --> 00:34:27,965
-Do you think that girl is reliable?
-I don't know.

298
00:34:28,766 --> 00:34:31,885
Come on. We are going to Yenisehir.

299
00:34:32,326 --> 00:34:35,925
Now? Are you serious, mother?

300
00:34:36,085 --> 00:34:39,405
I cannot rest and stay here anymore. Come on.

301
00:34:56,966 --> 00:35:00,445
This is the end of the tracks.

302
00:35:03,406 --> 00:35:09,645
-We will go into the forest and keep searching!
-Yes my Shahzade. Come on valiants!

303
00:35:28,286 --> 00:35:30,925
My Shahzade!

304
00:35:37,606 --> 00:35:41,205
They dropped their servant suits here.

305
00:35:43,326 --> 00:35:46,525
They snuck into the palace with these.

306
00:35:46,766 --> 00:35:50,605
They took out their dresses and went.

307
00:35:51,566 --> 00:35:55,525
But where did they go?

308
00:36:01,406 --> 00:36:06,405
You are watchful Veysel. Once again you won my favor.

309
00:36:16,846 --> 00:36:20,725
They removed the traces of the cars.

310
00:36:21,886 --> 00:36:27,285
Then they must have gone this way my Shahzade.

311
00:36:30,286 --> 00:36:32,845
Come on.

312
00:36:39,926 --> 00:36:48,085
Osman Bey, I heard about the incident you experienced.
I hope it gets better soon.

313
00:36:48,166 --> 00:36:53,085
-Thank you Ayhan Agha, thank you.
-Is there anything I can do?

314
00:36:53,246 --> 00:36:57,605
You don't have many losses I hope.

315
00:36:58,926 --> 00:37:03,005
Osman Bey, I don't want to be misunderstood.

316
00:37:03,126 --> 00:37:07,885
I'm not only here to offer you my best wishes.

317
00:37:08,046 --> 00:37:12,285
I can make front payment

318
00:37:12,406 --> 00:37:17,445
for the caravan that you agreed to protect,
if deemed suitable.

319
00:37:20,006 --> 00:37:23,245
Ayhan Agha.

320
00:37:23,646 --> 00:37:30,325
Your gold is not enough for me. How much gold do you have?

321
00:37:30,446 --> 00:37:37,245
I mean, I have so much gold that even the pharaoh

322
00:37:37,526 --> 00:37:42,325
can only dream about it. And it is at your service, Osman Bey.

323
00:37:42,406 --> 00:37:47,485
Praise be, Ayhan Agha, thank you.

324
00:37:47,846 --> 00:37:54,845
Gold or gold coins are the least we can
give to the leader of ummah, Bayindir Bey.

325
00:37:55,526 --> 00:37:59,205
Is that so?

326
00:38:00,526 --> 00:38:03,925
Very well.

327
00:38:06,246 --> 00:38:10,045
Them prepare your gold.

328
00:38:10,526 --> 00:38:14,565
I'll ask for it when needed.

329
00:38:17,446 --> 00:38:20,725
Goodbye.

330
00:38:34,526 --> 00:38:36,645
-Bayindir.
-My Bey.

331
00:38:36,766 --> 00:38:40,645
Send an Alp after him, find out what he is up to.

332
00:38:40,806 --> 00:38:45,045
Yes, my Bey. Yes, but

333
00:38:45,286 --> 00:38:49,685
did Ayhan Agha do something wrong?

334
00:38:50,926 --> 00:38:56,205
We don't know who is the friend and who is the enemy.

335
00:38:59,286 --> 00:39:04,005
Until then, he will be deemed suspicious.

336
00:39:04,166 --> 00:39:08,645
Look, he had been informed before everyone else.

337
00:39:08,806 --> 00:39:15,445
Obviously he is watching us. We will see.

338
00:39:15,526 --> 00:39:22,285
Was it because he is a trader or traitor?

339
00:39:23,166 --> 00:39:26,245
Yes, my Bey.

340
00:39:32,486 --> 00:39:36,765
This is Bayindir Bey's warehouse.

341
00:39:37,206 --> 00:39:41,445
There might be something wrong, my Shahzade.

342
00:39:41,526 --> 00:39:44,685
There's only one way to find that out.

343
00:39:46,486 --> 00:39:50,045
-Aykurt.
-Come on.

344
00:40:04,006 --> 00:40:06,485
Open it.

345
00:40:12,486 --> 00:40:16,005
Search everywhere, come on.

346
00:40:35,366 --> 00:40:40,445
My Shahzade, there's servant outfit.

347
00:40:41,806 --> 00:40:46,045
Thankfully, there's no gold in the cottage.

348
00:40:46,686 --> 00:40:49,725
Thankfully.

349
00:41:03,326 --> 00:41:06,445
Open it.

350
00:41:46,326 --> 00:41:49,525
How could Bayindir Bey do this?

351
00:41:50,526 --> 00:41:53,925
I don't want to make assumptions,

352
00:41:54,086 --> 00:42:02,165
but it seems Bayindir Bey's desire for gold made him blind.

353
00:42:10,846 --> 00:42:16,685
You shed the blood of my alps on my treasure.

354
00:42:17,046 --> 00:42:20,565
Whoever did this

355
00:42:20,726 --> 00:42:25,005
he will pay for this heavily.

356
00:42:25,126 --> 00:42:30,365
I swear, whoever did this

357
00:42:30,766 --> 00:42:34,485
in the middle of this hall

358
00:42:35,606 --> 00:42:40,005
I'll cut his head off.

359
00:42:43,846 --> 00:42:47,205
Yakup Bey and others are coming, my Bey.

360
00:42:47,846 --> 00:42:51,885
Yakup Bey, Saadet Hatun.

361
00:42:52,046 --> 00:42:56,645
-Welcome.
I'm so sorry to hear the incident, Malhun Hatun.

362
00:42:56,886 --> 00:43:01,485
-Thank you.
-A friend in need is a friend indeed.

363
00:43:01,566 --> 00:43:04,925
Of course we'd come.

364
00:43:07,766 --> 00:43:13,525
Shahzade Alaeddin, Boran brother will get better, right?

365
00:43:14,406 --> 00:43:19,565
Of course he will get better I hope,
don't be sad.

366
00:43:24,246 --> 00:43:28,965
Saadet Hatun. Let's have a seat.

367
00:43:34,446 --> 00:43:39,885
Osman Bey is in the council you may come, Yakup Bey.

368
00:43:44,686 --> 00:43:47,845
This is a huge weakness Malhun Hatun.

369
00:43:48,006 --> 00:43:52,365
But you'll learn from it. The palace is not like a tent.

370
00:43:52,446 --> 00:43:57,205
Precautions must be taken for every person
that goes in and out.

371
00:44:34,286 --> 00:44:39,005
The bigger the trouble is, the more the enemies are.

372
00:44:39,166 --> 00:44:42,245
Of course, Gonca Hatun.

373
00:44:43,086 --> 00:44:48,245
But we are used to the sneaks in the Frontiers.

374
00:44:49,406 --> 00:44:54,485
That's why we always have an antidote.

375
00:44:57,406 --> 00:45:00,205
We'll surely find out who did this to us

376
00:45:00,286 --> 00:45:04,205
and punish them severely.

377
00:45:07,486 --> 00:45:11,365
You fight with the snakes in the Frontiers

378
00:45:11,446 --> 00:45:15,965
and I fight with the devils with the face of an angel.

379
00:45:17,366 --> 00:45:22,765
You know that snake would hurt and
take precautions accordingly

380
00:45:22,846 --> 00:45:30,525
but there are some people that smile at you
but do dirty tricks behind your back.

381
00:45:30,806 --> 00:45:36,285
You're talking about hypocrisy, you're right,
Saadet Hatun.

382
00:45:40,246 --> 00:45:44,245
May Allah protect us all from their wrath.

383
00:45:44,486 --> 00:45:50,885
-Welcome to your palace, Bala Hatun.
-You welcome too.

384
00:45:54,206 --> 00:45:57,245
Welcome, Bala.

385
00:45:58,846 --> 00:46:01,685
Have a seat.

386
00:46:18,526 --> 00:46:25,045
We have never met in person before
but I heard a lot about you.

387
00:46:34,806 --> 00:46:41,485
What are you going to say, Osman Bey?
You tried to do something you cannot handle.

388
00:46:41,806 --> 00:46:45,445
You'll embarrass us all.

389
00:46:45,726 --> 00:46:48,325
Yakup Bey.

390
00:46:48,886 --> 00:46:54,805
Tell me. Did you send those letters to Beys?

391
00:46:54,886 --> 00:47:01,445
Are all the Beys ready for the battle
we will make with Mongols?

392
00:47:01,646 --> 00:47:05,565
Everyone has to do his part.

393
00:47:05,806 --> 00:47:09,365
We will not pay the tax

394
00:47:09,526 --> 00:47:13,605
and we will form an army.

395
00:47:16,686 --> 00:47:21,605
Wouldn't Mongol intelligence find it out?

396
00:47:21,966 --> 00:47:26,245
Do you want to ruin these lands?

397
00:47:27,886 --> 00:47:32,805
While we have a Bey like you,
we don't even need an enemy.

398
00:47:33,046 --> 00:47:36,445
Yakup Bey.

399
00:47:37,126 --> 00:47:41,445
When you told me to pay that tax,

400
00:47:41,526 --> 00:47:45,205
my palace was raided.

401
00:47:45,406 --> 00:47:51,245
Now, should I consider this as a game as well?

402
00:47:51,606 --> 00:47:56,365
What are saying, Osman Bey?
Is that what you think?

403
00:47:58,006 --> 00:48:00,885
If I thought so,

404
00:48:01,686 --> 00:48:07,365
...you wouldn't be in my council with me.

405
00:48:12,726 --> 00:48:15,125
What I'm saying now is...

406
00:48:16,006 --> 00:48:19,485
You should trust me about the gold matter.

407
00:48:21,286 --> 00:48:24,045
I'll take care of it.

408
00:48:26,166 --> 00:48:28,525
Thank you.

409
00:48:29,366 --> 00:48:33,445
And I'll start our moves against Mongolians.

410
00:48:34,126 --> 00:48:36,485
So tell me now.

411
00:48:37,326 --> 00:48:39,925
How many horsemen can you prepare?

412
00:48:42,406 --> 00:48:46,445
Sorry for your trouble.
You're alright now, aren't you?

413
00:48:46,726 --> 00:48:50,325
I'm good. How are you?

414
00:48:50,366 --> 00:48:53,645
Your arrival in the frontiers was so sudden.

415
00:48:54,366 --> 00:48:56,925
Have you got used to it?

416
00:48:59,766 --> 00:49:04,485
Thankfully, Malhun Hatun helped us feel at home here.

417
00:49:04,726 --> 00:49:06,925
Right?

418
00:49:08,006 --> 00:49:10,805
Yes, Saadet Hatun.

419
00:49:11,086 --> 00:49:13,245
Saadet Hatun is good at...

420
00:49:13,286 --> 00:49:17,885
...seeing everywhere like her own home.
She never feels like a stranger.

421
00:49:23,686 --> 00:49:27,365
You two have a tough challenge, hatuns.

422
00:49:27,726 --> 00:49:31,805
Being two hatuns in one house.

423
00:49:32,926 --> 00:49:36,205
It's our challenge, Saadet Hatun.

424
00:49:36,326 --> 00:49:38,765
Everyone has a different challenge.

425
00:49:38,926 --> 00:49:41,605
-Of course, we should...
-Of course.

426
00:49:41,686 --> 00:49:45,485
Of course. But I wouldn’t..

427
00:49:45,886 --> 00:49:48,405
...let it happen.

428
00:49:52,246 --> 00:49:55,285
Bala Hatun, are you alright?

429
00:49:55,606 --> 00:49:59,365
-Water! Bring warm water!
-Bala.

430
00:49:59,606 --> 00:50:02,165
I'm good. I'm fine.

431
00:50:02,326 --> 00:50:05,965
I'm wayworn. Sorry for this.

432
00:50:06,206 --> 00:50:08,685
I should rest.

433
00:50:20,566 --> 00:50:26,045
-Bala! Bala! Hatuns!
-Bala Hatun!

434
00:50:26,526 --> 00:50:30,165
Take her to her room quickly! Come on!

435
00:50:39,726 --> 00:50:41,845
Mother, we should let father know.

436
00:50:41,846 --> 00:50:44,325
Be patient, dear. When she wakes up, we will.

437
00:50:44,406 --> 00:50:47,925
He's dealing with problems now. Slowly. Slowly.

438
00:50:51,526 --> 00:50:53,685
Ulgen.

439
00:50:55,806 --> 00:50:58,565
You go to the market place.

440
00:51:31,326 --> 00:51:34,285
Carry the gold to the treasure room!

441
00:51:37,886 --> 00:51:40,125
My Shahzade.

442
00:51:40,246 --> 00:51:43,725
Praise be to you and the alps!

443
00:51:43,926 --> 00:51:47,885
You took the gold back from
those traitors!

444
00:51:48,326 --> 00:51:53,725
We got the gold. Now we have to expose
the traitor among us.

445
00:51:54,046 --> 00:52:00,485
Well... When he shows up I'll
choke him to death!

446
00:52:01,486 --> 00:52:06,485
Tell me, my Shahzade.
Where did you find the gold?

447
00:52:06,726 --> 00:52:11,325
The traitor must have left
some evidence behind.

448
00:52:11,926 --> 00:52:14,565
-Evidence..
-Yes.

449
00:52:15,686 --> 00:52:19,845
He left evidence, Bayindir Bey. But...

450
00:52:20,366 --> 00:52:24,565
We'll tell only Osman Bey
about the evidence.

451
00:52:26,126 --> 00:52:29,965
What are you saying, my Shahzade?
We have a spy among us?

452
00:52:30,326 --> 00:52:34,045
Yes, sure. A huge palace.
Many go in and out.

453
00:52:34,246 --> 00:52:38,725
You're right, my Shahzade. We shouldn't
talk about this in a public place.

454
00:52:38,886 --> 00:52:44,045
You are right. We should never talk
in public places.

455
00:52:45,246 --> 00:52:48,485
-Bayindir Bey.
-Yes?

456
00:52:50,326 --> 00:52:53,725
-Where is Osman Bey?
-He must be in the council.

457
00:52:53,926 --> 00:52:59,005
My Shahzade, my Bey will be happy to
hear the good news.

458
00:52:59,006 --> 00:53:01,445
-Let's go.
-Bayindir Bey.

459
00:53:04,686 --> 00:53:06,725
You stay here.

460
00:53:18,566 --> 00:53:22,925
My Shahzade, shall we hold Bayindir Bey?

461
00:53:27,486 --> 00:53:31,365
Not now. Get the gates closed.

462
00:53:31,646 --> 00:53:34,965
-Don't let him go anywhere.
-As you order, my Shahzade.

463
00:53:35,246 --> 00:53:37,885
Oguz, hold the gates.

464
00:53:41,726 --> 00:53:45,725
-What's the situation.
-We looked everywhere in the palace, Konur Bey.

465
00:53:45,726 --> 00:53:49,365
-Except for the rooms of Beys.
-Search the rooms of Beys too.

466
00:53:49,366 --> 00:53:51,565
It's an important matter.

467
00:53:54,566 --> 00:53:58,885
I'll search Bayindir Bey's room.
You get to the other rooms.

468
00:54:49,446 --> 00:54:53,245
Why is this gold in Bayindir Bey's room?

469
00:54:54,326 --> 00:54:57,925
You trust your warriors so much,
Osman Bey.

470
00:54:58,326 --> 00:55:01,085
If Allah permits...

471
00:55:02,046 --> 00:55:08,845
...our alps won't have to test each other
in the battlefield one day.

472
00:55:10,766 --> 00:55:13,965
Then you'll see if your 10.000 men...

473
00:55:14,046 --> 00:55:18,485
...are equal to 100.00 or not.

474
00:55:21,806 --> 00:55:25,205
When the beys we're expecting arrive,

475
00:55:25,526 --> 00:55:28,725
...we won't test each other...

476
00:55:29,286 --> 00:55:32,045
...but slaughter the heathens.

477
00:55:35,366 --> 00:55:38,245
There is no victor except Allah!

478
00:55:38,606 --> 00:55:40,845
You're right.

479
00:55:40,926 --> 00:55:43,525
Do I have permission, my Bey?

480
00:55:44,166 --> 00:55:47,005
Come in, Orhan!

481
00:55:49,886 --> 00:55:54,085
-My Bey.
-Speak.

482
00:56:01,166 --> 00:56:05,045
Excuse usz Yakup Bey.
There is an important matter.

483
00:56:05,086 --> 00:56:08,445
You may leave, Osman Bey.

484
00:56:09,086 --> 00:56:10,965
-Baysungur.
-My Bey.

485
00:56:11,246 --> 00:56:15,405
-Take care of Yakup Bey.
-As you order, my Bey.

486
00:56:23,286 --> 00:56:25,925
You didn't come back with empty hands, did you?

487
00:56:25,966 --> 00:56:30,845
I didn't, my Bey. All the gold is in the palace now.

488
00:56:36,966 --> 00:56:39,485
Why do you have a sullen face?

489
00:56:42,246 --> 00:56:44,925
Where we found the gold...

490
00:56:48,086 --> 00:56:51,205
It's Bayindir Bey's house.

491
00:56:58,406 --> 00:57:03,365
What are you saying, Orhan? It can't be him.

492
00:57:03,526 --> 00:57:07,805
-There must be a game.
-Those who took the gold from Yenisehir...

493
00:57:08,086 --> 00:57:12,685
They removed their trails.
But we detected them, my Bey.

494
00:57:13,726 --> 00:57:18,485
The trails led us to Bayindir Bey's house.

495
00:57:20,366 --> 00:57:22,725
And, my Bey...

496
00:57:23,086 --> 00:57:27,005
The clothes of those who attacked were in the same place.

497
00:57:28,086 --> 00:57:31,085
What are you saying, son?

498
00:57:32,566 --> 00:57:34,805
It can't be true.

499
00:57:36,126 --> 00:57:40,125
Someone who knew must have put them.
Someone is pulling a trick.

500
00:57:40,326 --> 00:57:42,765
Bayindir can't...

501
00:57:42,966 --> 00:57:47,245
...have got Boran shot. For gold? No.

502
00:57:48,446 --> 00:57:51,725
Bayindir? No.

503
00:57:53,846 --> 00:57:56,045
My Bey.

504
00:58:02,166 --> 00:58:05,565
-All the palace was search.
-And?

505
00:58:06,086 --> 00:58:10,765
These pouches are from the treasure.

506
00:58:17,406 --> 00:58:22,005
But we found them in Bayindir Bey's room.

507
00:58:39,926 --> 00:58:42,725
-Orhan.
-My Bey.

508
00:58:43,526 --> 00:58:45,605
Bring Bayindir to me.

509
00:58:45,686 --> 00:58:48,885
He'll be in front of my eyes until the truth is revealed.

510
00:58:48,926 --> 00:58:51,405
As you order, my Bey.

511
00:59:05,086 --> 00:59:09,005
The gold has been found! There is no problem anymore.

512
00:59:09,246 --> 00:59:13,565
Thanks to Allah, Osman Bey. Thanks to Allah.

513
00:59:14,686 --> 00:59:17,325
But it's not enough.

514
00:59:17,766 --> 00:59:21,605
Did you find who performed the betrayal?

515
00:59:22,406 --> 00:59:26,165
Yes, we did! We did!

516
00:59:26,486 --> 00:59:29,405
Good. Good.

517
00:59:29,566 --> 00:59:32,565
You should behead him immediately.

518
00:59:33,846 --> 00:59:37,005
In such a betrayal

519
00:59:37,206 --> 00:59:40,765
...the traitor should be beheaded.

520
00:59:43,246 --> 00:59:45,925
Yakup Bey.

521
00:59:49,886 --> 00:59:53,045
We are struggling to become a state here.

522
00:59:53,366 --> 00:59:58,485
I can say the words to give death sentence easily.

523
00:59:59,366 --> 01:00:03,045
But I intend to serve justice...

524
01:00:03,806 --> 01:00:07,165
...with a court, a judge...

525
01:00:07,526 --> 01:00:10,765
..and with evidence.

526
01:00:11,926 --> 01:00:15,285
Not with the words a Bey says,

527
01:00:15,566 --> 01:00:20,845
...but with the justice itself.

528
01:00:22,766 --> 01:00:28,965
You say you will set a court and let it decide, huh?

529
01:00:31,686 --> 01:00:35,205
You intended to take the gold, Yakup Bey.

530
01:00:36,126 --> 01:00:38,925
The problem has been solved.

531
01:00:39,886 --> 01:00:42,725
The rest is my internal matter.

532
01:00:43,766 --> 01:00:47,805
-Let me see you off.
-No.

533
01:00:49,726 --> 01:00:53,125
If you insist on a court,

534
01:00:53,526 --> 01:00:56,805
..I will attend as the Sultan.

535
01:00:59,246 --> 01:01:05,165
Since the day when you pledged loyalty,
there has been no internal or external, Osman Bey.

536
01:01:07,886 --> 01:01:13,245
Let's see how the justice will be served.

537
01:01:18,806 --> 01:01:22,045
When we have the court,

538
01:01:22,966 --> 01:01:26,645
...you will see the justice for yourself.

539
01:01:27,886 --> 01:01:30,285
You will see.

540
01:01:43,646 --> 01:01:47,565
Here, here.

541
01:01:47,806 --> 01:01:53,005
Wonder how happy Osman Bey got,
after receiving the good news.

542
01:01:53,086 --> 01:01:59,885
My Shahzada, who knows how proud of you he is.

543
01:02:03,526 --> 01:02:06,965
Arrest Bayindir Bey.

544
01:02:12,286 --> 01:02:16,325
Bayindir Bey, you are guilty of..

545
01:02:16,486 --> 01:02:22,325
Stealing the treasure, wounding Boran Bey
and murdering our Alps.

546
01:02:24,406 --> 01:02:27,805
What are you saying my Shahzada?

547
01:02:28,006 --> 01:02:33,965
-What gold? What murdering?
-Evidence is clear.

548
01:02:34,366 --> 01:02:39,445
The golds have been found in your quarters, not only that..

549
01:02:39,526 --> 01:02:43,765
The same golds have been found in
your room as well, Bayindir Bey.

550
01:02:43,846 --> 01:02:47,925
Perish the thought. That is slander.

551
01:02:48,606 --> 01:02:52,165
Do I even need gold.

552
01:02:52,246 --> 01:02:58,525
How am I to accuse for wounding Boran,
my brother, my comrade.

553
01:02:58,606 --> 01:03:05,845
You all know me. It is me Bayindir of Cavundur.

554
01:03:08,846 --> 01:03:13,965
Did Yakup Bey convinced you? Or was it for yourself.

555
01:03:14,126 --> 01:03:17,685
Couldn’t you control your nafs, Bayindir Bey?

556
01:03:18,086 --> 01:03:22,485
What Yakup Bey? What nafs?

557
01:03:23,646 --> 01:03:26,765
Don't do it, my Shahzada.

558
01:03:27,086 --> 01:03:29,765
Take him to prison.

559
01:03:30,126 --> 01:03:32,925
Take my head, my Shahzada.

560
01:03:33,006 --> 01:03:36,005
Take my head instead of putting this dirt to my name.

561
01:03:36,086 --> 01:03:40,405
Let them not say Bayindir has sold his cause.

562
01:03:52,246 --> 01:03:56,045
Do not be late.

563
01:03:56,166 --> 01:03:59,205
Give the medicine I prepared to Boran Bey every hour.

564
01:03:59,286 --> 01:04:02,645
-Couple of drops would be enough.
-As you command, my Shahzada.

565
01:04:02,726 --> 01:04:05,005
Alright, go.

566
01:04:06,046 --> 01:04:09,445
Alaeddin Bey.

567
01:04:10,566 --> 01:04:13,605
Look who is here.

568
01:04:15,806 --> 01:04:20,965
So you wander around as a healer today.
I Wonder what you'll be tomorrow.

569
01:04:21,166 --> 01:04:24,365
I'll take that as a compliment.

570
01:04:25,646 --> 01:04:28,685
You have a lot of confidence. However..

571
01:04:28,806 --> 01:04:32,165
This much is no good. Let me tell you that.

572
01:04:32,246 --> 01:04:34,565
You don't seem so angry today.

573
01:04:34,846 --> 01:04:38,205
Did you start drinking camomile tea,
Trickster Hatun?

574
01:04:38,366 --> 01:04:40,285
-Scholar..
-Got it, you didn't.

575
01:04:40,366 --> 01:04:44,965
However, I told you to drink once a day.
This anger of yours, is no good.

576
01:04:45,046 --> 01:04:48,925
Howver, my duty calls. With your permission,
Trickster Hatun.

577
01:04:50,806 --> 01:04:53,765
Is Bala Hatun okay?

578
01:04:58,166 --> 01:05:00,845
Did something happen to my mother?

579
01:05:02,166 --> 01:05:05,125
She passed out, they took her to her room.

580
01:05:05,246 --> 01:05:07,485
What are you saying?

581
01:05:30,286 --> 01:05:33,365
Tell me, Kismet. How is she?

582
01:05:34,726 --> 01:05:38,525
She has fever. She must've got cold coming here.

583
01:05:38,606 --> 01:05:41,125
After resting a bit, she will get better.

584
01:05:41,246 --> 01:05:45,245
I had them make soup from bone broth.
It will help her get better I hope.

585
01:05:45,246 --> 01:05:46,045
I hope so.

586
01:05:57,046 --> 01:05:59,445
Kismet.

587
01:06:03,406 --> 01:06:05,845
-Malhun.
-Bala.

588
01:06:05,926 --> 01:06:10,205
Thank Allah, she is getting better. Are you alright?

589
01:06:11,566 --> 01:06:13,805
I am alright.

590
01:06:14,846 --> 01:06:17,085
Mother.

591
01:06:21,326 --> 01:06:22,725
Mother, are you alright?

592
01:06:22,806 --> 01:06:26,285
Thank Allah she is alright. Don't worry.

593
01:06:26,446 --> 01:06:30,125
So, what happened? Father
told me you were alright?

594
01:06:30,206 --> 01:06:34,965
She got tired on the road.
She is alright now though, look.

595
01:06:35,046 --> 01:06:37,965
I am alright. Don't worry.

596
01:06:38,086 --> 01:06:42,845
Alright, be good mother.
Kismet Hatun, boil cassidony.

597
01:06:43,006 --> 01:06:45,725
I already did my Shahzada.
I will bring it now.

598
01:06:45,806 --> 01:06:50,125
Do not hinder it. You will drink it until
you get better, alright mother?

599
01:06:50,206 --> 01:06:54,005
I am alright.

600
01:06:54,126 --> 01:06:56,645
Look I don't want to come here
because of this.

601
01:06:56,726 --> 01:06:58,725
I made you all worried.

602
01:06:58,806 --> 01:07:03,005
Don't say this Bala. Of course we be worried.

603
01:07:03,286 --> 01:07:06,605
You got up fast thinking that
you got better, mother.

604
01:07:06,726 --> 01:07:09,485
You will be away from Alaca a little bit more.

605
01:07:10,046 --> 01:07:11,965
Right, Kismet Hatun?

606
01:08:00,606 --> 01:08:03,565
Are we allowed in, my Bey?

607
01:08:03,686 --> 01:08:05,925
Come.

608
01:08:22,366 --> 01:08:25,965
-I didn't do anything my Bey.
-Get out!

609
01:08:34,526 --> 01:08:37,245
You say you didn't do anything.

610
01:08:39,486 --> 01:08:42,404
But everything comes out of your room.

611
01:08:43,086 --> 01:08:47,404
My Bey. Someone is playing trickery.

612
01:08:48,046 --> 01:08:50,885
When did you go to your post last time?

613
01:08:51,166 --> 01:08:54,925
My Bey, it has been years. It is also just sitting empty.

614
01:08:55,126 --> 01:08:59,805
You say it is emtpy. However, it was full when Alps arrived.

615
01:08:59,886 --> 01:09:02,245
All of our treasure was there.

616
01:09:02,366 --> 01:09:04,885
Don't do it my Bey.

617
01:09:10,966 --> 01:09:13,484
How many people know this.

618
01:09:14,046 --> 01:09:18,085
Not many, only Alps.

619
01:09:19,805 --> 01:09:22,005
What about this?

620
01:09:22,606 --> 01:09:28,325
My Bey, it is certain that who plays the trickery plays it well.

621
01:09:37,006 --> 01:09:38,805
My Bey.

622
01:09:39,446 --> 01:09:41,564
May Allah help you as you did to me.

623
01:09:41,645 --> 01:09:45,245
You were there in my worst times.

624
01:09:45,446 --> 01:09:51,404
You took my by your side. So I knew your cause as mine.

625
01:09:52,206 --> 01:09:55,205
I never doubted you once.

626
01:09:55,406 --> 01:09:58,605
I spilled my blood..

627
01:09:59,246 --> 01:10:03,805
To realize your dream. My Bey..

628
01:10:05,926 --> 01:10:11,565
Do you really believe that I would betray you?

629
01:10:26,806 --> 01:10:29,765
After all these years.

630
01:10:30,566 --> 01:10:33,605
After all this time.

631
01:10:35,406 --> 01:10:37,325
I want to believe not to your act..

632
01:10:38,206 --> 01:10:41,205
But to your word.

633
01:10:42,046 --> 01:10:46,645
However, I believe in court evidence.

634
01:10:49,286 --> 01:10:51,365
Here..

635
01:10:52,726 --> 01:10:55,245
Evidence is there.

636
01:11:07,526 --> 01:11:11,845
My Bey, I know your justice the best.

637
01:11:12,286 --> 01:11:15,685
If no one knows, I do.

638
01:11:16,926 --> 01:11:21,925
My Bey, like every sinner, I am scared of death as well.

639
01:11:23,406 --> 01:11:25,805
I am, however..

640
01:11:27,406 --> 01:11:31,685
If you think that I am a traitor..

641
01:11:31,766 --> 01:11:36,285
I do not want to live. Take my head.

642
01:11:36,566 --> 01:11:38,405
No.

643
01:11:39,246 --> 01:11:45,525
No. What I believe won't change anything.

644
01:11:49,126 --> 01:11:52,205
There will be a court.

645
01:11:52,686 --> 01:11:56,605
If a head has to be taken..

646
01:11:59,766 --> 01:12:03,325
Justice will decide that.

647
01:12:06,366 --> 01:12:08,605
Alps!

648
01:12:17,646 --> 01:12:20,405
Take him.

649
01:12:44,006 --> 01:12:47,925
My son, you will find out if Bayindir has to do with this.

650
01:12:48,046 --> 01:12:49,605
Until tomorrow's court.

651
01:12:49,726 --> 01:12:51,605
What do you want me to do, Bey Father?

652
01:12:51,606 --> 01:12:55,685
You will check everything again and again, thoroughly.

653
01:12:57,366 --> 01:12:58,885
What's on your mind

654
01:12:59,006 --> 01:13:02,565
His mind is on Mother Bala, Bey Father.

655
01:13:02,646 --> 01:13:06,045
What happened to Bala? Mother Bala is here, in the palace.

656
01:13:06,126 --> 01:13:08,165
However, she is not well.

657
01:13:08,246 --> 01:13:11,965
-She passed out this morning, father.
-What are you saying.

658
01:13:24,646 --> 01:13:28,605
You see? Bala fell ill.

659
01:13:28,766 --> 01:13:32,325
And Malhun did not even let Osman know.

660
01:13:33,126 --> 01:13:36,525
So, mother. Your work is easy.

661
01:13:37,806 --> 01:13:41,285
What is easier than set two hatun against each other.

662
01:13:41,366 --> 01:13:43,605
It is not like that, son.

663
01:13:43,686 --> 01:13:46,805
Both of them fought for beylik.

664
01:13:46,886 --> 01:13:48,845
I saw it in their eyes.

665
01:13:49,246 --> 01:13:51,965
Bala is the daughte of a sheikh.

666
01:13:52,126 --> 01:13:56,405
She got her manners from her father.
She says alright to everything.

667
01:13:56,486 --> 01:14:00,805
Malhun, is the daughter of Bey. She is smart.

668
01:14:01,006 --> 01:14:04,885
She came to this house knowing her challenges.

669
01:14:13,046 --> 01:14:15,485
What will you do, mother?

670
01:14:15,686 --> 01:14:18,885
This work falls upon you my valiant.

671
01:14:19,126 --> 01:14:21,405
Neither Bala nor Malhun.

672
01:14:21,486 --> 01:14:25,445
We first act on Orhan.

673
01:14:25,686 --> 01:14:29,365
You want to take revenge for your spilled blood, right?

674
01:14:30,006 --> 01:14:32,725
-Tell me to hit and I'll do it.
-No.

675
01:14:33,606 --> 01:14:36,645
We'll do such a thing to Orhan that

676
01:14:36,726 --> 01:14:40,685
there won't be any blood but it will be painful.

677
01:14:43,206 --> 01:14:46,925
I sent a letter to Holofira and invited
her to the marketplace.

678
01:14:47,006 --> 01:14:51,005
She's a beautiful girl, she must be good at trade as well.

679
01:14:51,206 --> 01:14:53,885
If you marry Holofira,

680
01:14:53,966 --> 01:14:56,685
our trade with the lords will get better.

681
01:14:56,766 --> 01:15:00,765
We will gain the trust of Christian people.

682
01:15:01,246 --> 01:15:04,125
And it will make Orhan go crazy.

683
01:15:05,086 --> 01:15:09,685
When he breaks up with Holofira because of her mother

684
01:15:09,966 --> 01:15:13,485
and when we take Holofira,

685
01:15:13,806 --> 01:15:17,485
he will even be the enemy of his own household.

686
01:15:19,766 --> 01:15:22,165
Holofira.

687
01:15:33,726 --> 01:15:36,645
Saadet Hatun invites me to the frontier marketplace.

688
01:15:36,726 --> 01:15:39,485
Are you going to go, princess?

689
01:15:44,766 --> 01:15:48,445
I'm not sure if I should.

690
01:15:50,646 --> 01:15:53,405
Seeing Orhan does not help me at all.

691
01:15:53,486 --> 01:15:56,325
Princess, are you still...

692
01:15:56,406 --> 01:15:58,285
It doesn't matter.

693
01:15:59,086 --> 01:16:01,805
Orhan didn't even say farewell.

694
01:16:02,006 --> 01:16:05,965
He loves his family more than everyone else.

695
01:16:06,326 --> 01:16:08,645
Especially his mother.

696
01:16:08,766 --> 01:16:11,845
His family does not want you, but

697
01:16:11,926 --> 01:16:16,085
If Orhan Bey really loves you
he wouldn't listen to anyone else,

698
01:16:16,166 --> 01:16:20,245
and he wouldn't send you away, right?

699
01:16:21,126 --> 01:16:23,845
I don't know.

700
01:16:26,886 --> 01:16:31,285
His eyes still look the same, but...

701
01:16:34,086 --> 01:16:38,165
...how can someone believe that one’s in love with her?

702
01:16:38,366 --> 01:16:42,605
It's a difficult question, princess.

703
01:16:47,686 --> 01:16:52,765
Tell the soldiers to get ready. We'll set out.

704
01:16:58,806 --> 01:17:02,645
There will be court order in the hall. Everyone knows his part.

705
01:17:02,766 --> 01:17:06,845
My Shahzade, what if Yakup Bey is involved in this?

706
01:17:08,326 --> 01:17:11,205
They are in our palace during the court.

707
01:17:11,406 --> 01:17:15,085
If they are responsible for what happened,

708
01:17:15,286 --> 01:17:18,805
I'll punish them all in this hall.

709
01:17:23,886 --> 01:17:27,125
Did you find the gold, Orhan Bey?

710
01:17:28,126 --> 01:17:31,845
We did, we did, Mehmed Bey.

711
01:17:32,606 --> 01:17:36,005
When did we leave something that belongs to us?

712
01:17:36,166 --> 01:17:39,405
We will punish the one who stole it as well.

713
01:17:40,166 --> 01:17:42,845
And you're boasting with it.

714
01:17:43,406 --> 01:17:48,405
Your palace was raided, someone inside you betrayed you...

715
01:17:48,766 --> 01:17:52,125
You're not even sure about your Bey's loyalty

716
01:17:52,206 --> 01:17:55,245
but you're dreaming about establishing a state.

717
01:17:56,766 --> 01:17:59,405
You should be ashamed.

718
01:17:59,846 --> 01:18:02,845
What we have is so great that

719
01:18:03,166 --> 01:18:06,325
even the inside man's going after it

720
01:18:06,526 --> 01:18:10,125
and the outsider.

721
01:18:10,766 --> 01:18:14,725
Are you jealous of

722
01:18:14,806 --> 01:18:19,005
what you can't achieve, Mehmed... Bey?

723
01:18:19,246 --> 01:18:21,125
What are you going to do Orhan?

724
01:18:21,126 --> 01:18:24,525
Will you do your job secretly and disguise
yourself as someone else?

725
01:18:24,606 --> 01:18:29,005
No. Making vile plans

726
01:18:29,086 --> 01:18:31,165
is your thing.

727
01:18:31,726 --> 01:18:36,645
Wash your hands before throwing mud at somebody.
When we are on bad terms

728
01:18:36,886 --> 01:18:40,845
you’ll feel the cold of my sword, don't worry about it.

729
01:18:40,926 --> 01:18:44,965
-Orhan!
-Mehmed!

730
01:18:49,726 --> 01:18:51,685
My Shahzade.

731
01:18:52,046 --> 01:18:54,485
Wait.

732
01:18:54,566 --> 01:18:57,165
He's our guest.

733
01:18:59,926 --> 01:19:03,685
Keep an eye on your Shahzade, Konur Bey.

734
01:19:03,886 --> 01:19:09,085
Otherwise when he dies, you will not
be able to explain it to Osman Bey.

735
01:19:11,406 --> 01:19:14,645
Or you can't go to your Osman Bey at all.

736
01:19:14,766 --> 01:19:18,325
You need to be brave at the right time,

737
01:19:19,606 --> 01:19:22,845
don't trust your youthfulness and waste yourself.

738
01:20:23,846 --> 01:20:27,565
Bala, my Bala.

739
01:20:28,406 --> 01:20:31,405
-Are you alright?
-I'm alright.

740
01:20:31,486 --> 01:20:36,405
Children told me that you fainted and
I saw you lying on the ground...

741
01:20:36,486 --> 01:20:39,485
-You're alright, right?
Among all those things

742
01:20:39,566 --> 01:20:41,925
I'm bothering you as well, right?

743
01:20:42,006 --> 01:20:46,485
Of course not, look at me don't say such things.

744
01:20:46,566 --> 01:20:50,805
You can only be my crown.

745
01:20:51,166 --> 01:20:54,485
You can only be the crown.

746
01:20:56,566 --> 01:21:01,085
Look at me, you are alright, right?

747
01:21:01,166 --> 01:21:03,765
Your sickness did not relapse, right?

748
01:21:03,886 --> 01:21:06,885
I'm alright my Osman.

749
01:21:06,966 --> 01:21:10,725
I couldn't stay when I heard about the raid.

750
01:21:11,686 --> 01:21:15,125
I wanted to be with you, but

751
01:21:15,246 --> 01:21:18,005
I guess riding the horse tired me out.

752
01:21:18,206 --> 01:21:21,685
Very well. Just get better,

753
01:21:21,766 --> 01:21:24,685
I'm well when you are well.

754
01:21:24,766 --> 01:21:27,765
This situation makes me think, my Osman.

755
01:21:28,006 --> 01:21:31,765
The enemy tries to surround us all around.

756
01:21:31,886 --> 01:21:35,205
It is time to vigilant all the time.

757
01:21:35,286 --> 01:21:37,685
That's why

758
01:21:39,286 --> 01:21:41,525
you'll stay in Sogut.

759
01:21:41,726 --> 01:21:46,085
The defense of Sogut is very important, if you stay there

760
01:21:46,166 --> 01:21:48,405
I'll not worry.

761
01:21:50,926 --> 01:21:56,645
Of course, my Bey. Sogut is our first.

762
01:21:56,726 --> 01:22:00,925
My sheikh, my father's breath is there,

763
01:22:01,006 --> 01:22:03,445
I'll protect it at all costs.

764
01:22:04,646 --> 01:22:09,845
-May I come in, my Bey?
-Come on in, son.

765
01:22:19,646 --> 01:22:23,085
Praise be! Praise be!

766
01:22:23,366 --> 01:22:26,605
Thanks to Allah, mother.
Thanks to Allah.

767
01:22:27,366 --> 01:22:31,485
As I see you like this, I feel like I am getting stronger.

768
01:22:32,206 --> 01:22:34,965
My brave son...

769
01:22:35,606 --> 01:22:38,525
If I am standing here right now, it is thanks to you.

770
01:22:38,526 --> 01:22:41,285
You'll be alright mother.
You'll be alright if Allah permits.

771
01:22:41,286 --> 01:22:44,165
-I am alright.
-My Bey father.

772
01:22:44,926 --> 01:22:47,445
-I found something, but..
-What is it?

773
01:22:47,566 --> 01:22:52,205
They did not leave any tracks, but..

774
01:22:53,846 --> 01:22:56,765
...they left this.

775
01:22:59,806 --> 01:23:04,085
We took this out from our injured Alps.
Our healers had it.

776
01:23:04,206 --> 01:23:06,925
This is not one of our arrows, my Bey.

777
01:23:07,006 --> 01:23:09,685
This belongs to infidels.

778
01:23:10,926 --> 01:23:15,445
I went to Boran Bey. I looked at his wounds.

779
01:23:15,566 --> 01:23:19,165
Those wounds could not be caused by our swords.

780
01:23:19,966 --> 01:23:23,925
Those were infidel daggers, my Bey father.

781
01:23:25,206 --> 01:23:27,165
This proof is not enough.

782
01:23:27,246 --> 01:23:31,285
Dig the graves of dogs who died here. Right now.

783
01:23:31,366 --> 01:23:33,765
Yes my Bey.

784
01:23:50,326 --> 01:23:54,205
Attention! Osman Bey!

785
01:24:50,326 --> 01:24:55,365
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too.

786
01:25:02,766 --> 01:25:05,245
Here, Yakub Bey.

787
01:25:15,646 --> 01:25:18,765
On the 23rd day of the month of Rabul Ahir...

788
01:25:18,886 --> 01:25:23,005
..a bad incident took place in Yenisehir.

789
01:25:23,326 --> 01:25:27,605
Today the truth will be revealed.

790
01:25:28,326 --> 01:25:31,045
O, Muslim people.

791
01:25:31,526 --> 01:25:38,805
VAIIahi, I swear I did not betray.

792
01:25:39,086 --> 01:25:45,125
If I have any fault, it is not being able to arrive on time...

793
01:25:45,286 --> 01:25:48,965
...and help my companions, my brother Boran.

794
01:25:49,046 --> 01:25:51,445
Silence, Bayindir Bey, silence.

795
01:25:51,526 --> 01:25:55,405
First the court will speak, witnesses will be heard...

796
01:25:55,526 --> 01:25:58,325
..evidence will be seen.

797
01:25:58,686 --> 01:26:03,285
Orhan Bey, explain what you saw before the court.

798
01:26:03,366 --> 01:26:05,645
Yes, dear judge.

799
01:26:05,766 --> 01:26:09,205
We, with the word of Veysel, traced them.

800
01:26:09,406 --> 01:26:15,005
Then the tracks took us to the house of Bayindir Bey.

801
01:26:15,166 --> 01:26:17,365
The house...

802
01:26:32,166 --> 01:26:34,205
Yes dear judge.

803
01:26:34,646 --> 01:26:37,805
The gold was found in Bayindir Bey's room.

804
01:26:37,886 --> 01:26:40,165
I didn't want to bring someone under suspicion.

805
01:26:41,449 --> 01:26:45,289
I told you what I heard.
This is what it is.

806
01:26:45,804 --> 01:26:50,574
Bayindir Bey, is the place mentioned yours?

807
01:26:53,195 --> 01:26:55,155
Yes, it is mine, dear judge.

808
01:26:55,158 --> 01:26:58,818
But I don't know about the rest.
I don't know about the gold or the treasure.

809
01:26:58,910 --> 01:27:03,250
Have you seen that move all by yourself?
Is there anyone behind this?

810
01:27:04,366 --> 01:27:08,805
Dear judge. I am telling you that I am innocent...

811
01:27:08,966 --> 01:27:13,165
-But you are trying to learn if I have any partners.
-Bayindir Bey!

812
01:27:13,566 --> 01:27:17,965
Everyone knows how much you love gold.

813
01:27:19,926 --> 01:27:22,885
What do you want to do by hiding your guilt?

814
01:27:22,966 --> 01:27:24,865
Son.

815
01:27:25,806 --> 01:27:28,205
This is the place of justice.

816
01:27:31,886 --> 01:27:33,845
Everyone...

817
01:27:34,326 --> 01:27:37,405
...can be judged because of their actions.

818
01:27:37,606 --> 01:27:40,005
Not their past.

819
01:27:40,846 --> 01:27:42,965
Be quiet.

820
01:27:44,566 --> 01:27:46,925
My Shahzade...

821
01:27:47,166 --> 01:27:50,085
The love I had for gold..

822
01:27:50,166 --> 01:27:54,445
...was unfortunately an impossible love.

823
01:27:54,966 --> 01:28:00,045
Long time ago, I gave up on that love.

824
01:28:03,126 --> 01:28:08,965
But what can I do? It did not give up on me.

825
01:28:11,046 --> 01:28:15,205
It was in my destiny to fall because of that.

826
01:28:16,166 --> 01:28:20,405
Maybe it is the sin of what you did in your past.

827
01:28:27,246 --> 01:28:32,525
Osman Bey... Did you witness the incident?

828
01:28:32,606 --> 01:28:34,445
No.

829
01:28:35,686 --> 01:28:37,725
Just..

830
01:28:38,366 --> 01:28:41,725
...just the things I heard here.

831
01:28:42,446 --> 01:28:46,125
Yakub Bey... Did you hear something?

832
01:28:46,206 --> 01:28:48,925
It happened in this palace.

833
01:28:49,286 --> 01:28:55,005
How can I hear the thing
Osman Bey does not know, dear judge?

834
01:28:55,166 --> 01:28:57,005
I do not know.

835
01:28:57,286 --> 01:29:02,405
Is there anyone who can witness
for the benefit Bayindir Bey?

836
01:29:22,726 --> 01:29:24,885
Come on, my son.

837
01:29:26,206 --> 01:29:31,405
Come on! Come on! It's about Bayindir Bey's life! Come on!

838
01:29:50,846 --> 01:29:53,285
My Shahzade!

839
01:29:58,046 --> 01:30:00,565
Come on!

840
01:30:18,686 --> 01:30:23,685
Then... we need to make a decision.

841
01:30:26,366 --> 01:30:32,565
It was in my destiny to fall because of a
slander despite my innocence.

842
01:30:33,126 --> 01:30:36,165
O, the Ummah of Muhammad (PBUH).

843
01:30:37,326 --> 01:30:40,165
If I did anything good for you...

844
01:30:40,366 --> 01:30:44,365
...I am giving you all my pardon in this world and Qiyamah.

845
01:30:44,606 --> 01:30:49,525
But... I want one
thing from my Allah..

846
01:30:51,606 --> 01:30:55,365
Do not remember me as a traitor.

847
01:30:58,566 --> 01:31:01,685
Clerk Efendi. Note the date.

848
01:31:01,766 --> 01:31:04,285
Now it is time to announce the decision.

849
01:31:09,846 --> 01:31:13,845
The finger cut by sharia does not hurt.

850
01:31:14,966 --> 01:31:18,965
I can sacrifice myself for your justice, dear judge.

851
01:31:20,166 --> 01:31:23,965
Now it is time to hear the decision, Malhun Hatun.

852
01:31:25,166 --> 01:31:28,285
The evidence was confirmed.

853
01:31:28,366 --> 01:31:32,645
Bayindir Bey's guilt was proven because
the stolen gold was found in his house...

854
01:31:32,726 --> 01:31:37,165
...and the same gold was found in...

855
01:31:37,246 --> 01:31:39,045
...his room during the search.

856
01:31:39,126 --> 01:31:43,245
His guilt is proven by the testimony of the
Beys and the Alps.

857
01:31:43,286 --> 01:31:45,885
Because of the theft and the amount of gold stolen...

858
01:31:45,886 --> 01:31:50,125
...his hand must be cut off, and...

859
01:31:50,206 --> 01:31:54,845
...because of the blood shed from our martyred Alps,
Bayindir Bey...

860
01:31:59,006 --> 01:32:02,245
..is sentenced to death.

861
01:32:24,206 --> 01:32:27,325
Implement the decision.

862
01:32:35,246 --> 01:32:37,645
Are you sure about your decision, dear judge?

863
01:32:37,766 --> 01:32:41,125
Yes, in the light of the evidence.

864
01:32:48,126 --> 01:32:51,485
Do you allow me, Osman Bey?

865
01:32:54,326 --> 01:32:57,245
I do not.

866
01:33:06,286 --> 01:33:08,805
Dear judge.

867
01:33:11,686 --> 01:33:14,525
If you allow me..

868
01:33:17,726 --> 01:33:20,285
I want to carry out his execution.

869
01:33:25,926 --> 01:33:29,285
Such a pity, he was a brave man.

870
01:33:53,726 --> 01:33:56,685
Come on.

871
01:34:42,526 --> 01:34:46,205
I believe your innocence.

872
01:34:46,326 --> 01:34:49,965
Alhamdulillah.

873
01:34:50,366 --> 01:34:55,165
Take my head. Alhamdulillah.

874
01:35:13,486 --> 01:35:18,165
I bear witness that there is none worthy of
worship except Allah,

875
01:35:18,966 --> 01:35:22,605
I bear witness that

876
01:35:23,286 --> 01:35:26,845
Muhammad is the Messenger of Allah,

877
01:35:52,726 --> 01:35:57,965
Come on son. Come on.

878
01:36:11,046 --> 01:36:13,885
Stop!

879
01:36:20,246 --> 01:36:23,045
Thankfully.

880
01:36:26,006 --> 01:36:33,325
Dear judge, my Bey. Bayindir Bey is innocent!

881
01:36:47,406 --> 01:36:52,445
-What's your proof Alaeddin Bey?
-Alps!

882
01:37:17,606 --> 01:37:22,405
They all have the same trace in the same place
but they hid one of them.

883
01:37:22,486 --> 01:37:25,605
-Bayindir Bey is innocent.
-Yes, he is.

884
01:37:25,686 --> 01:37:29,285
Thankfully!

885
01:37:41,046 --> 01:37:43,685
That's my boy.

886
01:37:44,686 --> 01:37:47,125
Dear judge.

887
01:37:54,006 --> 01:37:58,445
The attackers were the crusaders.

888
01:37:59,206 --> 01:38:02,085
They obviously set a trap.

889
01:38:02,166 --> 01:38:09,285
Their goal is not the treasure alone,
they want us to fight with each other.

890
01:38:10,566 --> 01:38:13,605
My Bey, then they set a trap for me as well.

891
01:38:13,726 --> 01:38:17,005
They left me alive for me to inform you back.

892
01:38:17,166 --> 01:38:20,885
Both the sword and arrow aimed at Boran Bey
came from the crusaders.

893
01:38:21,126 --> 01:38:24,325
The ones who stole the gold as well.

894
01:38:25,806 --> 01:38:29,365
It is clear that Bayindir Bey is innocent

895
01:38:29,566 --> 01:38:34,365
considering the proof Alaeedin Bey brought.

896
01:38:39,686 --> 01:38:43,685
Give me your pardon, Bayindir Bey.

897
01:39:19,926 --> 01:39:24,045
Instant judgment is not good,
right Saadet Hatun?

898
01:39:26,126 --> 01:39:32,605
Since his own Bey didn't believe him,
we had to doubt as well.

899
01:39:32,886 --> 01:39:36,645
But thank Allah, it is better this way.

900
01:39:36,726 --> 01:39:43,485
Otherwise a great Bey would have been
died because of the lack of perception.

901
01:39:43,726 --> 01:39:47,285
Since the justice has been secured

902
01:39:47,526 --> 01:39:50,845
we should leave, Osman Bey.

903
01:39:52,686 --> 01:39:58,125
Do your duty in an honest way just like your justice.

904
01:39:58,606 --> 01:40:01,805
Have a safe journey.

905
01:40:07,406 --> 01:40:12,205
Don't worry, whoever set this trap

906
01:40:13,046 --> 01:40:16,165
I swear they will be ruined.

907
01:40:16,846 --> 01:40:20,005
Thank you, Osman Bey!

908
01:40:30,366 --> 01:40:35,245
Osman!

909
01:40:45,846 --> 01:40:50,125
Rejoice all you want, Osman.

910
01:40:50,526 --> 01:40:53,525
Rejoice because Bayindir was saved.

911
01:40:53,846 --> 01:40:59,285
But I'll put an end to your joy.

912
01:41:19,286 --> 01:41:27,805
Make the preparations, we'll make a bloodshed
in Sogut in two days.

913
01:41:31,726 --> 01:41:37,005
This time, I'll stick my dagger to

914
01:41:38,166 --> 01:41:40,885
Osman's heart.

915
01:41:41,126 --> 01:41:46,885
We'll incite the people in Sogut and cause a rebellion, right?

916
01:41:47,006 --> 01:41:53,805
Not rebellion Vasilis we'll make a raid.

917
01:41:54,286 --> 01:41:59,685
As honorable Christian soldiers, as Crusaders,

918
01:42:01,326 --> 01:42:05,685
we'll make a bloodshed in Sogut.

919
01:42:06,366 --> 01:42:11,365
For that reason, someone has to sneak our soldiers inside.

920
01:42:13,926 --> 01:42:15,965
Tesellius.

921
01:42:16,486 --> 01:42:22,645
He's been living in Sogut for years.
They know him as Hasan Agha.

922
01:42:22,726 --> 01:42:26,885
-They trust him a lot.
-Hasan Agha.

923
01:42:30,766 --> 01:42:35,245
You'll sneak our soldiers in Tesellius.

924
01:42:35,406 --> 01:42:37,965
Excuse me, Master Gera.

925
01:42:38,166 --> 01:42:41,685
But why do we set Christians as target

926
01:42:41,886 --> 01:42:45,525
instead of causing a secret rebellion inside.

927
01:42:45,646 --> 01:42:50,845
In order to unite Christians and lords Vasilis.
This is not just our war.

928
01:42:50,966 --> 01:42:54,765
This is the war of cross and crescent!

929
01:42:55,886 --> 01:43:01,245
After our raid, all of the lords will unite.

930
01:43:01,646 --> 01:43:05,165
The slaughter we will start in Sogut will spread,

931
01:43:05,286 --> 01:43:08,645
Everywhere Muslims breathe

932
01:43:09,366 --> 01:43:11,845
Bilecik,

933
01:43:13,406 --> 01:43:18,285
Inegol, Karacahisar,

934
01:43:18,566 --> 01:43:23,365
everywhere Muslims breathe...

935
01:43:24,486 --> 01:43:29,285
The enemy is concerned about our unity,
that's for sure.

936
01:43:29,406 --> 01:43:35,205
But thanks to my Creator,
He helped us ruin this plan.

937
01:43:35,286 --> 01:43:37,605
-Thankfully.
-Thankfully.

938
01:43:37,686 --> 01:43:43,885
And it was so crucial that there couldn't even
be a single doubt among us.

939
01:43:44,166 --> 01:43:49,245
But we were patient until the end.

940
01:43:49,446 --> 01:43:55,045
Thanks to my Rabb, He showed us the truth.

941
01:43:55,766 --> 01:44:00,765
So, Bayindir, since they made the plan through you,

942
01:44:01,046 --> 01:44:04,725
then it will be your duty to find them.

943
01:44:05,086 --> 01:44:07,725
For sure, my Bey.

944
01:44:08,206 --> 01:44:11,725
Thanks to my Rabb Who brought us together again.

945
01:44:11,886 --> 01:44:15,325
-Thanks to Him.
-Thanks to Him.

946
01:44:15,406 --> 01:44:19,045
Come on then, enjoy your food.

947
01:44:19,166 --> 01:44:21,725
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

948
01:44:21,886 --> 01:44:26,645
We would be happier if Boran was here.

949
01:44:33,766 --> 01:44:36,445
Boran.

950
01:44:38,046 --> 01:44:41,245
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too!

951
01:44:41,326 --> 01:44:46,605
Praise be! You got up, is that so?

952
01:44:47,486 --> 01:44:51,565
-Brother, are you better?
-I'm alright my Bey.

953
01:44:51,726 --> 01:44:56,325
-Of course I'd join such a table.
-Praise be! come on.

954
01:44:56,486 --> 01:45:00,565
Come here.

955
01:45:05,806 --> 01:45:11,605
Since Boran is here, now we can
rejoice twice as much

956
01:45:13,326 --> 01:45:18,005
-Let us have it then.
-Thank Allah, thank Allah.

957
01:45:22,366 --> 01:45:25,285
Enjoy.

958
01:45:26,366 --> 01:45:30,845
Then my Bey, it is now time for our..

959
01:45:30,926 --> 01:45:34,725
Double weddings.

960
01:45:37,046 --> 01:45:40,565
-Right, Bala?
-Yes.

961
01:45:41,246 --> 01:45:46,085
It is time. Right, Shahzadas?

962
01:45:48,046 --> 01:45:51,405
There is still time.

963
01:45:51,486 --> 01:45:54,245
Do you want to get rid of us?

964
01:45:54,326 --> 01:45:58,085
Look here, look here.

965
01:45:58,166 --> 01:46:01,565
You made your mothers tired enough.

966
01:46:01,646 --> 01:46:04,005
Let other hatuns take care of your problems.

967
01:46:04,206 --> 01:46:07,965
That is near as well, my Bey.
We've sent word to all around.

968
01:46:08,086 --> 01:46:12,085
We're looking for brides that are fit for
our Shahzadas.

969
01:46:16,206 --> 01:46:21,205
What are you looking for?
Both of their brides are ready.

970
01:46:21,286 --> 01:46:23,445
-And..
-Sister.

971
01:46:23,526 --> 01:46:26,685
You must be hungry.
Go ahead and eat.

972
01:46:26,766 --> 01:46:30,645
Let her eat a lot and speak less.

973
01:46:42,326 --> 01:46:45,805
Osman's little son is quite clever.

974
01:46:45,926 --> 01:46:51,245
He is not like his brother.

975
01:46:53,486 --> 01:46:56,205
He is, mother.

976
01:46:58,366 --> 01:47:01,005
However, why are we talking about this.

977
01:47:01,206 --> 01:47:05,565
The grandson of Sheikh Edebali.
He has Ahi Community with him.

978
01:47:05,646 --> 01:47:11,285
And sisters. From what I heard people like him as well.

979
01:47:11,646 --> 01:47:13,485
Yes, mother.

980
01:47:13,646 --> 01:47:17,965
Alaeddin's heart is nearly falling for you, Gonca.

981
01:47:23,726 --> 01:47:29,565
-What are you saying, dear mother?
-You heard what I said.

982
01:47:30,446 --> 01:47:33,925
I saw how he looked at you.

983
01:47:35,406 --> 01:47:37,645
Mother, I..

984
01:47:37,766 --> 01:47:41,485
You will make Alaeddin fall for you, Gonca.

985
01:47:41,726 --> 01:47:45,325
You will make him love you so much..

986
01:47:45,366 --> 01:47:48,685
That he will do everything you say.

987
01:47:48,766 --> 01:47:53,365
-Mother, what are you saying?
-You heard what I said, Gonca.

988
01:47:53,606 --> 01:47:58,645
You are a smart girl.
You know what to do.

989
01:48:01,326 --> 01:48:03,765
Do not.

990
01:48:04,806 --> 01:48:09,325
Do not, Gonca, fall for him.

991
01:48:10,006 --> 01:48:14,205
I know that you do not show weakness, however..

992
01:48:14,446 --> 01:48:18,525
It is duty, understood?

993
01:48:19,166 --> 01:48:22,245
As you command, mother.

994
01:48:22,326 --> 01:48:29,805
You will have a cart of supplies prepared tomorrow.
You will take it to Sogut, Bala Hatun.

995
01:48:42,246 --> 01:48:46,645
Make way! Osman Bey!

996
01:48:51,486 --> 01:48:55,445
Alps are ready Bey. Scouts are on their way too.

997
01:48:55,526 --> 01:49:01,645
-The roads are ready too.
-Thank you, thank you.

998
01:49:02,166 --> 01:49:06,525
May you travel swiftly Bey. Come as you go.

999
01:49:06,606 --> 01:49:09,245
And bring joy with good news,
if Allah permits.

1000
01:49:09,326 --> 01:49:13,125
Thank you, thank you.
Do not worry.

1001
01:49:13,326 --> 01:49:17,805
Bala, do not try to ride a horse
before completely healing.

1002
01:49:17,926 --> 01:49:21,445
Do not worry Bey. May you come back swiftly.

1003
01:49:21,766 --> 01:49:25,445
-Thank you, thank you. Alright then.
-My Bey.

1004
01:49:25,566 --> 01:49:29,805
I don't feel at ease.
I want to come with you if you allow it.

1005
01:49:29,966 --> 01:49:33,005
We do not know what this
Mongolian dog will do.

1006
01:49:33,086 --> 01:49:36,165
My brother is right, Bey. I want to come with you too.

1007
01:49:36,246 --> 01:49:40,285
No, my sons. You have a greater task.

1008
01:49:40,486 --> 01:49:44,245
You will stay here as my eyes.

1009
01:49:46,606 --> 01:49:49,645
Now, hear me well.

1010
01:49:51,086 --> 01:49:53,485
While I'm gone..

1011
01:49:53,886 --> 01:49:59,165
You will be in charge of the palace.

1012
01:50:01,006 --> 01:50:03,125
Look..

1013
01:50:03,206 --> 01:50:08,405
Do not act careless today in the court.

1014
01:50:08,526 --> 01:50:13,685
Do not decide on anything before making sure.

1015
01:50:13,806 --> 01:50:15,885
As you command, Bey.

1016
01:50:17,246 --> 01:50:21,445
Do not worry Bey Father.
I will lead well if Allah permits.

1017
01:50:21,566 --> 01:50:24,085
May you travel swiftly.

1018
01:50:24,166 --> 01:50:28,685
I do not worry son. Palace is in your hands.

1019
01:50:30,886 --> 01:50:32,845
Son.

1020
01:50:34,726 --> 01:50:37,845
You will go to Sogut.

1021
01:50:38,806 --> 01:50:42,325
You are entrusted with your mother as well.

1022
01:50:43,766 --> 01:50:48,685
I will do my best father.
May you travel swiftly, if Allah permits.

1023
01:50:48,846 --> 01:50:53,205
Thank you. Thank you to all.

1024
01:50:53,286 --> 01:50:55,525
Time for me to go.

1025
01:51:43,966 --> 01:51:46,965
GERMIYANOGULLARI BORDER - FRONTIER BAZAAR

1026
01:51:47,526 --> 01:51:52,805
So Orhan Bey. You lead the Beys for now.

1027
01:51:52,886 --> 01:51:56,565
-How do you feel, brother?
-Want to know how it is?

1028
01:51:56,766 --> 01:52:00,965
It is like I carry all the weight of
Yenisehir on my shoulders.

1029
01:52:01,246 --> 01:52:08,565
You need a hatun to share that weight brother,
don't handle it alone.

1030
01:52:08,966 --> 01:52:12,205
-Sister.
-Don't get mad at me.

1031
01:52:12,286 --> 01:52:18,205
My mother sent word to all around,
she is looking for a bride.

1032
01:52:35,966 --> 01:52:39,045
Malhun Hatun.

1033
01:52:40,526 --> 01:52:43,885
You look very busy these days, however..

1034
01:52:43,966 --> 01:52:48,965
Come to me when you're free.
I have things to talk with you.

1035
01:52:51,206 --> 01:52:56,525
What happened Saadet Hatun. If it is so important,
say it here.

1036
01:52:56,606 --> 01:52:58,125
Do not tire me.

1037
01:52:58,326 --> 01:53:03,285
Every matter has a place and a time
to be talked about.

1038
01:53:16,046 --> 01:53:20,205
You will punish the hatuns who
made this disaster of rugs.

1039
01:53:20,286 --> 01:53:23,245
-What are you saying Saadet Hatun?
-You heard what I said.

1040
01:53:23,326 --> 01:53:26,805
I can not allow such disrespect on my lands.

1041
01:53:26,886 --> 01:53:28,925
Saadet Hatun.

1042
01:53:29,606 --> 01:53:34,845
It was your Alps, who collect
all the goods like there's a fire.

1043
01:53:34,966 --> 01:53:39,365
It is their fault. And wasn't that paid for already?

1044
01:53:41,846 --> 01:53:46,285
Malhun Hatun. I told you this is not the time.

1045
01:53:46,366 --> 01:53:50,085
Our matter is different now.

1046
01:53:50,286 --> 01:53:55,725
Cerkutay Bey. Introduce our new merchant.

1047
01:53:57,646 --> 01:54:01,565
My mother, I will go if you allow me.

1048
01:54:01,726 --> 01:54:04,205
Alright, son.

1049
01:54:04,966 --> 01:54:09,125
Now hear me well. All of you..

1050
01:54:09,246 --> 01:54:14,085
Meet with the new merchant of our bazaar.

1051
01:54:24,686 --> 01:54:27,845
Holofira Hatun!

1052
01:55:01,886 --> 01:55:04,965
Holofira?

1053
01:55:36,686 --> 01:55:42,885
I wish you good luck with your new bench,
Holofira Hatun.

1054
01:56:45,646 --> 01:56:48,165
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too.

1055
01:56:48,286 --> 01:56:51,085
May it be easy Hasan Agha, what's your load?
Let me see.

1056
01:56:51,166 --> 01:56:54,685
I've brought wheat, here, take a look.

1057
01:57:04,806 --> 01:57:08,965
Here it is.

1058
01:57:12,926 --> 01:57:19,045
-What about the others?
-Legumes and such.

1059
01:57:19,366 --> 01:57:23,125
-Here, you may enter Hasan Agha.
-Thank you.

1060
01:57:30,966 --> 01:57:34,605
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

1061
01:57:52,206 --> 01:57:54,685
My Hatun, you don't stop at all.

1062
01:57:54,806 --> 01:57:58,845
I lose my power when I lie down, Kismet.
I'll sleep when I get tired.

1063
01:57:58,966 --> 01:58:03,685
I promised my Osman Bey, if you don't get rest,
I'll have to inform him.

1064
01:58:03,846 --> 01:58:06,925
Look at you.

1065
01:58:07,486 --> 01:58:10,325
May Allah bless you Bala Hatun.

1066
01:58:10,406 --> 01:58:14,285
You're my aide, why would someone report her Hatun?

1067
01:58:27,886 --> 01:58:29,885
Come on.

1068
01:58:39,926 --> 01:58:44,685
-Peace be upon you Bala Hatun.
-Peace be upon you too. Welcome.

1069
01:58:44,766 --> 01:58:50,685
Thank you. My mother send her regards,
she sent this for the soup kitchen.

1070
01:58:50,966 --> 01:58:54,365
Thank you. May Allah bless her.

1071
01:58:57,086 --> 01:59:03,765
This is my mother Saadet Hatun's gift,
we owe Alaeddin Bey our lives.

1072
01:59:11,606 --> 01:59:17,485
Thanks. Saadet Hatun is very thoughtful.

1073
01:59:19,526 --> 01:59:23,325
-Sogut is such a peaceful place.
-It is.

1074
01:59:23,486 --> 01:59:27,245
Sogut is not like any other place.

1075
01:59:28,166 --> 01:59:32,245
If you'll excuse me, I want to help with something as well.

1076
01:59:32,406 --> 01:59:36,005
Of course, if you want to do so.

1077
01:59:39,366 --> 01:59:42,365
Kismet Hatun.

1078
01:59:56,086 --> 02:00:00,485
Here. Praise be!

1079
02:00:03,166 --> 02:00:08,325
I feel ashamed to breath when I see people starving.

1080
02:00:08,406 --> 02:00:11,445
That's right.

1081
02:00:11,606 --> 02:00:18,765
However, all of them are challenges.
Poverty, wealth are challenges of humanity.

1082
02:00:18,846 --> 02:00:25,165
Forgetting what Allah has given you,
and thinking all you own is yours.

1083
02:00:25,246 --> 02:00:30,965
That is why, it is hard to give.

1084
02:00:35,086 --> 02:00:37,885
However, sharing is caring.

1085
02:00:38,006 --> 02:00:42,485
Since you know caring, you can come
whenever you want, Gonca Hatun.

1086
02:00:42,566 --> 02:00:44,885
Of course I will.

1087
02:01:01,166 --> 02:01:05,485
Mother, didn't we send you to Sogut to rest?

1088
02:01:05,726 --> 02:01:11,085
Look here, I feel very well here.

1089
02:01:15,566 --> 02:01:18,525
Don't stand around, come on and help us.

1090
02:01:18,606 --> 02:01:21,085
-Mother.
-Quickly.

1091
02:01:23,366 --> 02:01:28,325
-Come on my son, hold it.
-Alright.

1092
02:01:39,166 --> 02:01:41,525
Strength to your elbow, Trickster Hatun.

1093
02:01:42,846 --> 02:01:46,405
To you too, Scholar.

1094
02:01:53,766 --> 02:01:56,605
This is yours.

1095
02:01:57,206 --> 02:02:01,405
What is this? You bought me a gift?

1096
02:02:03,886 --> 02:02:07,725
My mother is grateful to you for
what you've done for my brother.

1097
02:02:07,966 --> 02:02:11,525
You're welcome. But I don't have space right now.

1098
02:02:14,406 --> 02:02:18,325
I am a messenger. You can give it back to my mother
if you don't want it.

1099
02:02:18,406 --> 02:02:22,565
Alright, let it be.

1100
02:03:00,846 --> 02:03:03,005
We're starting.

1101
02:03:03,086 --> 02:03:09,245
We crusaders will bring the end of
the crescent ourselves.

1102
02:03:11,206 --> 02:03:13,925
Come on.

1103
02:03:30,686 --> 02:03:34,765
In the well that welcomed Hadhrat Yusuf..

1104
02:03:34,886 --> 02:03:37,565
Were made from rocks like you.

1105
02:03:37,686 --> 02:03:41,485
Who knows what kind of soldiers and beys..

1106
02:03:41,766 --> 02:03:47,125
Went from this place, and couldn't see the
well by looking at rocks.

1107
02:03:47,206 --> 02:03:50,445
Couldn't see and greet.

1108
02:03:50,846 --> 02:03:55,805
As it is not proper to go without greeting.

1109
02:03:58,486 --> 02:04:01,965
It is not.

1110
02:04:04,686 --> 02:04:09,805
Peace be upon you.
Dervish Effendi, strength to your elbow.

1111
02:04:09,886 --> 02:04:15,005
Peace be upon you too.
Thank you.

1112
02:04:28,246 --> 02:04:31,445
Dervish Effendi.

1113
02:04:31,606 --> 02:04:34,205
-Our paths crossed again.
-Indeed.

1114
02:04:34,366 --> 02:04:37,085
-Thank you.
-Alps, come here.

1115
02:04:37,166 --> 02:04:41,005
Come here. So..

1116
02:04:41,246 --> 02:04:45,765
You did not let us to be ashamed against ants
in the other side before.

1117
02:04:45,926 --> 02:04:53,525
If you allow me, we would like to help you
carry these rocks to there together.

1118
02:04:53,606 --> 02:04:58,565
Looks like your load is heavy, your load is long.
Don't bother.

1119
02:04:58,646 --> 02:05:03,725
It will not bother us at all. Quickly, Alps.

1120
02:05:03,806 --> 02:05:06,725
Come on.

1121
02:05:18,526 --> 02:05:21,965
-Here.
-Thank you, thank you.

1122
02:05:22,046 --> 02:05:26,165
If Allah grants us with completing the well...

1123
02:05:26,246 --> 02:05:29,205
...next time, you will drink
from the well, if Allah permits.

1124
02:05:29,286 --> 02:05:35,565
I hope so, I hope so.
I asked your name when we met earlier...

1125
02:05:35,646 --> 02:05:39,565
...but you told me not to ask what you run away from.

1126
02:05:39,766 --> 02:05:44,725
Therefore, therefore, I won't ask your name.

1127
02:05:45,286 --> 02:05:49,045
I hope I will be granted
with drinking water from this well...

1128
02:05:49,246 --> 02:05:51,645
...and I hope I'll see you again.

1129
02:05:51,726 --> 02:05:54,485
-If Allah permits.
-Thus..

1130
02:05:54,606 --> 02:05:57,405
..we should go for now.

1131
02:05:57,486 --> 02:06:02,085
This poor man wants to give you some equipage.

1132
02:06:02,446 --> 02:06:07,005
-No, we have food.
-It is not a material...

1133
02:06:07,206 --> 02:06:11,005
...it is a meaning, if you accept it.

1134
02:06:11,126 --> 02:06:15,685
We always need that. Of course we want it.

1135
02:06:15,806 --> 02:06:20,365
Our Master (PBUH)...

1136
02:06:22,966 --> 02:06:27,885
...one of the days when he felt that the
migration to the other world was approaching...

1137
02:06:28,046 --> 02:06:33,125
...he went to the masjid.
His intention was to ask for his sahabas' pardon.

1138
02:06:33,206 --> 02:06:39,445
He could hardly stand with the help of
a sahaba. He calls out to his sahabas...

1139
02:06:39,526 --> 02:06:44,605
"O my Sabahas,
if anyone has any rights on me...

1140
02:06:44,726 --> 02:06:48,605
...let him speak."
No one speaks.

1141
02:06:48,806 --> 02:06:53,525
He says it for the second time.
Again, no one speaks.

1142
02:06:53,606 --> 02:06:57,645
After that, the Messenger of Allah calls out again.

1143
02:06:57,926 --> 02:07:03,645
A sahaba from the back stands up.
The name of...

1144
02:07:03,766 --> 02:07:08,685
...this sahaba is Ukkasha (R.A.).
Ukkasha says: O Messenger of Allah...

1145
02:07:09,046 --> 02:07:15,205
...you wanted to ride your camel in Hudaybiyyah,
I reached my hand to you.

1146
02:07:15,286 --> 02:07:20,725
You got on the camel, then while you were trying
to hit the camel with your whip...

1147
02:07:20,806 --> 02:07:26,365
...that whip hit my back. Now,
isn't this my right on you?

1148
02:07:26,446 --> 02:07:30,365
The Messenger of Allah says,
Oh Ukkasha...

1149
02:07:30,486 --> 02:07:36,205
...this is certainly your right.
Omer (RA) stands up in anger.

1150
02:07:36,286 --> 02:07:41,365
Our Prophet says,
"O Omer, do not interfere."

1151
02:07:41,446 --> 02:07:44,445
"This is my account."

1152
02:07:44,526 --> 02:07:49,605
Then Abu Bakr (RA) stands up and says,
"O Ukkasha...

1153
02:07:49,846 --> 02:07:55,085
I will give you as much property as you want.
Come and stop this madness."

1154
02:07:55,326 --> 02:08:00,565
Our Efendi says,
"O Abu Bakr, this is my account.

1155
02:08:00,646 --> 02:08:05,685
Don't interfere." Sahabas were also
trying hard not to say something.

1156
02:08:05,766 --> 02:08:11,565
Our Prophet turned to Ali (RA) and said,
"My daughter Fatima has that whip.

1157
02:08:11,686 --> 02:08:15,725
Go and bring that."
When Ali...

1158
02:08:15,886 --> 02:08:19,725
...explained the situation,
our mother Fatima became very sad.

1159
02:08:19,806 --> 02:08:27,365
"Don't you know that he is ill? Wasn't there someone
among you who could replace him?" she asked.

1160
02:08:27,486 --> 02:08:33,805
Then she sent Hasan and Hussein
who were children back then.

1161
02:08:33,886 --> 02:08:38,965
When Hasan and Hussein,
the dear grandchildren of our Prophet...

1162
02:08:39,046 --> 02:08:44,685
...entered the masjid, they went to
Ukkasha and said, "O Ukkasha...

1163
02:08:44,766 --> 02:08:51,445
...do not hit our grandfather.
Hit us. Let us pay for it."

1164
02:08:51,566 --> 02:08:55,365
Our Efendi says,
"How can I hurt you?...

1165
02:08:55,606 --> 02:08:59,405
...Besides,
this is my account."

1166
02:09:00,886 --> 02:09:07,005
The whip had come.
Sahabas were even more upset.

1167
02:09:07,086 --> 02:09:11,005
Our Efendi orders them to give the whip to Ukkasha.

1168
02:09:11,086 --> 02:09:18,285
When Ukkasha says, "O, Messenger of Allah,
when you hit with that whip..

1169
02:09:18,366 --> 02:09:26,605
...I did not have any clothes on my back.
Is that also my right on you?" Sahabas stand up.

1170
02:09:26,686 --> 02:09:34,565
Our Efendi calms them down and says
"Ukkasha is right."

1171
02:09:34,766 --> 02:09:42,885
He leaves the minbar, takes his shirt off
and waits for Ukkasha to hit with his whip.

1172
02:09:42,966 --> 02:09:48,405
Ukkasha raises the whip and then...

1173
02:09:48,606 --> 02:09:53,845
...he kissed the seal of prophethood of the
Messenger of Allah between his shoulder bones.

1174
02:09:54,086 --> 02:09:59,765
And in tears, he says "O Messenger of Allah...

1175
02:09:59,846 --> 02:10:06,765
I give my pardon to you. I can sacrifice
my mother and father for you."

1176
02:10:07,166 --> 02:10:14,765
That's what our Prophet, our guide did.

1177
02:10:14,926 --> 02:10:19,205
Justice is for everyone.

1178
02:10:19,566 --> 02:10:27,005
Take the stick and hit with
it to take what you want.

1179
02:10:27,366 --> 02:10:32,205
Hit, so justice will prevail.

1180
02:10:32,646 --> 02:10:37,245
Hit, so justice can come.

1181
02:10:37,606 --> 02:10:40,885
Raid! Raid!

1182
02:10:41,046 --> 02:10:47,645
Come on, brothers! It is time to take our revenge!
It is time to take what is ours!

1183
02:10:47,766 --> 02:10:52,405
Burn it down! Come on!

1184
02:11:04,406 --> 02:11:07,965
Burn them!

1185
02:11:33,726 --> 02:11:38,285
-Raid!
-Alps! My Shahzade!

1186
02:11:38,486 --> 02:11:42,685
My Shahzade, crusaders raided our place.

1187
02:11:43,086 --> 02:11:47,045
Come in! Come in!

1188
02:11:47,126 --> 02:11:49,685
Come on! Everyone inside!

1189
02:11:49,766 --> 02:11:52,765
Come on!

1190
02:11:52,886 --> 02:11:55,965
Come on! To the kitchen!

1191
02:11:56,086 --> 02:11:59,325
Come in! Go in there!

1192
02:11:59,406 --> 02:12:01,805
Come on! Gonca, go in there!

1193
02:12:01,886 --> 02:12:03,445
I will stay, Scholar. Come on!

1194
02:12:03,526 --> 02:12:05,805
Mother, go inside! You were entrusted to me!

1195
02:12:05,966 --> 02:12:10,405
Sogut is entrusted to me, my son! We turned everyone
who tried to burn Sogut into ashes.

1196
02:12:10,406 --> 02:12:12,085
We will do it again for sure.

1197
02:12:12,086 --> 02:12:14,565
Come on! Come on!

1198
02:12:14,646 --> 02:12:17,205
Come on!

1199
02:12:43,766 --> 02:12:48,325
Wait! Wait!

1200
02:12:48,446 --> 02:12:52,205
Look... Take your hand off or I will break your hand.

1201
02:12:52,286 --> 02:12:54,845
Wait!

1202
02:12:58,726 --> 02:13:01,405
Stop!

1203
02:13:10,286 --> 02:13:13,565
Welcome Osman Bey.

1204
02:13:18,846 --> 02:13:22,645
Call your Commander.

1205
02:13:27,126 --> 02:13:31,165
I see that you are always angry.

1206
02:13:31,646 --> 02:13:35,805
But do not speak loudly when talking to the Commander.

1207
02:13:35,926 --> 02:13:42,165
Our anger is not towards a place or a person.

1208
02:13:42,246 --> 02:13:48,085
We are angry because of the situation you put us in.
Come on!

1209
02:13:48,486 --> 02:13:53,645
Call your Commander! I brought the gold.

1210
02:14:12,726 --> 02:14:16,005
Where is the Commander?

1211
02:14:24,766 --> 02:14:29,645
I am the Commander, Osman Bey.

1212
02:14:41,726 --> 02:14:46,205
-Alright.
-Sit down.

1213
02:14:52,246 --> 02:14:58,885
I came to your table to get to know you better.

1214
02:14:59,286 --> 02:15:02,885
You didn't even give me a piece of food.

1215
02:15:02,966 --> 02:15:09,205
-Sit down. Eat.
-I did not come here to eat.

1216
02:15:10,886 --> 02:15:14,805
I will give you the gold and leave.

1217
02:15:17,326 --> 02:15:21,965
Sure, you will give the gold.

1218
02:15:29,926 --> 02:15:35,005
But don't be so sure about leaving.

1219
02:15:36,326 --> 02:15:40,605
Come on! Come on!

1220
02:15:40,686 --> 02:15:43,445
Come on!

1221
02:15:43,726 --> 02:15:48,685
e will burn it down! We will not show mercy on anyone!

1222
02:15:48,766 --> 02:15:53,765
You are the ones who will breathe
for the last time you dastards! Alps!

1223
02:15:54,526 --> 02:15:59,485
Allah is the Greatest!

1224
02:16:36,806 --> 02:16:40,844
-Mother, do not stay here!
-I will not leave the entrustment, my son.

1225
02:16:42,526 --> 02:16:46,125
Recite salaah. We are fighting!

1226
02:16:47,886 --> 02:16:51,285
Protect Bala Hatun.

1227
02:17:14,486 --> 02:17:19,445
Victory belongs to those who believe Allah.

1228
02:17:19,646 --> 02:17:26,245
Allah is the Greatest!

1229
02:17:50,406 --> 02:17:54,525
Who does this gold belong to, Osman?

1230
02:17:57,806 --> 02:18:01,645
Are you going to give me what is mine?

1231
02:18:01,925 --> 02:18:08,045
-This gold belongs to Konya, Osman.
-This is the gold that I inherited.

1232
02:18:08,726 --> 02:18:12,725
How is that yours?

1233
02:18:14,766 --> 02:18:20,004
I am Akcelasun.

1234
02:18:27,046 --> 02:18:32,325
Konya is mine, the palace is mine.

1235
02:18:32,446 --> 02:18:36,285
Why would the gold be yours, Osman?

1236
02:18:36,406 --> 02:18:41,844
Nokers! Arrest him!

1237
02:18:46,686 --> 02:18:48,645
You came to our land..

1238
02:18:48,726 --> 02:18:52,245
...and tried to rule the lands which did not
belong to you with cruelty!

1239
02:18:52,286 --> 02:18:55,285
But you will learn. You will learn...

1240
02:18:55,406 --> 02:18:59,645
The wolves are never slaves, they are always
the ones who question others.

1241
02:19:00,286 --> 02:19:04,525
Do you think you can survive here if you kill me?

1242
02:19:04,646 --> 02:19:07,084
It is not your concern, but mine

1243
02:19:08,091 --> 02:19:29,381
